// Curated new Daily Mysteries; introduced after the original schedule's published dates.
module.exports=[["Kyoto","World Cities",["My cultural influence outlasted my political prominence.","Ancient traditions remain visible beside modern neighborhoods.","Temples and carefully designed gardens draw visitors here.","My streets preserve the legacy of a former imperial center in East Asia.","Fushimi Inari's thousands of vermilion gates are found here."],[]],["Marrakesh","World Cities",["My streets turn commerce into a sensory experience.","A walled old district preserves layers of local history.","Markets and courtyards are central to my character.","My old square fills with performers and food stalls as evening approaches.","Jemaa el-Fnaa square anchors my famous medina."],[]],["Cusco","World Cities",["A vanished empire continues to shape my streets.","I sit high above sea level in a mountainous region.","Stonework from an earlier civilization survives in my center.","I was an important royal and ceremonial center in the central Andes.","Visitors often pass through me on their way to Machu Picchu."],[]],["Reykjavik","World Cities",["My location makes winter darkness and summer daylight dramatic.","Geothermal energy plays an everyday role here.","I sit on an island near the edge of the Arctic Circle.","I serve as the northern administrative center of a small Atlantic island nation.","I am Iceland's capital, and Hallgrímskirkja church rises above my streets."],[]],["Istanbul","World Cities",["My geography helped empires control important trade routes.","Religious and architectural traditions from different eras overlap here.","My waterway connects two seas and separates two continents.","My streets carry visible legacies of both Byzantine and Ottoman rulers.","Hagia Sophia and the Bosporus are major landmarks here."],[]],["Lima","World Cities",["Desert and ocean meet around my expanding neighborhoods.","My cuisine draws on several cultural traditions.","I sit on a Pacific coast in western South America.","I am a national capital along South America's Pacific coast.","My historic Plaza Mayor is in the capital of Peru."],[]],["Nairobi","World Cities",["Wild animals live surprisingly close to my busy neighborhoods.","My development accelerated as railways crossed East Africa.","My surroundings include savanna landscapes.","I am an East African capital built near highland savannas.","My city in Kenya borders a national park with lions and giraffes."],[]],["Hanoi","World Cities",["Lakes interrupt my busy network of streets.","Traditional neighborhoods preserve many specialized trades.","My streets are known for distinctive food and motorbike traffic.","I am a capital in mainland Southeast Asia with centuries of political history.","Hoàn Kiếm Lake lies near my Old Quarter in Vietnam."],[]],["Porto","World Cities",["A river valley helped shape my commercial history.","Tiled façades and steep streets define parts of my cityscape.","My name is closely associated with a fortified wine.","I am a major Portuguese city beside the Douro River.","My riverside Ribeira quarter faces historic wine cellars."],[]],["Edinburgh","World Cities",["A rocky hill dominates my skyline.","I balance medieval streets with a planned Georgian district.","Festivals bring major international audiences here.","I am a historic capital in the northern part of the British Isles.","My castle overlooks Scotland's Royal Mile."],[]],["Cartagena","World Cities",["Walls were built to protect me from maritime attacks.","Colorful balconies overlook streets with a colonial past.","My harbor played an important role in Caribbean trade.","A defensive wall still surrounds much of my brightly colored colonial center.","My walled old town is a UNESCO World Heritage site."],[]],["Dakar","World Cities",["Atlantic winds shape my coastal setting.","I grew as a commercial port on an African peninsula.","Music and contemporary art are important to my cultural life.","I am an Atlantic-facing capital on West Africa's coast.","Gorée Island lies offshore from my harbor in Senegal."],[]],["Florence","World Cities",["Patronage helped transform my city into a center of creativity.","My streets preserve bridges and civic squares from centuries past.","A powerful banking family influenced my artistic flourishing.","I lie on the Arno River in Tuscany, Italy.","Brunelleschi designed the great dome of my cathedral."],[]],["Osaka","World Cities",["My commercial history is entwined with food culture.","I am a major urban center near Japan's inland sea.","An early modern castle is one of my landmarks.","I am known for takoyaki and a lively Dōtonbori district.","My city's name is often associated with a large historic castle in Kansai."],[]],["Prague","World Cities",["My buildings reflect several centuries of architectural change.","A river divides my historic neighborhoods.","A medieval bridge carries visitors toward an old castle district.","My historic bridges connect districts of a Central European capital.","The astronomical clock faces my Old Town Square in the Czech Republic."],[]],["Valparaíso","World Cities",["Steep hills helped determine how residents move through me.","Colorful houses and street art cover parts of my slopes.","My harbor became important to Pacific shipping routes.","I am a Chilean port city with historic funiculars.","My hillside districts overlook the Pacific Ocean near Santiago."],[]],["Tallinn","World Cities",["Medieval walls still define my old center.","Digital innovation is a point of national pride around me.","My coastline faces a gulf of the Baltic Sea.","My medieval center belongs to one of the three Baltic states.","I am Estonia's capital, with a walled old town and pointed towers."],[]],["Muscat","World Cities",["Mountains meet the sea along my coastline.","My architecture emphasizes low-rise buildings and traditional forms.","Historic forts watch over my harbor.","I am an important capital on the eastern edge of the Arabian Peninsula.","The Sultan Qaboos Grand Mosque is among my landmarks in Oman."],[]],["La Paz","World Cities",["My steep terrain makes transportation unusual.","Homes rise across a dramatic bowl-shaped valley.","Cable cars provide important public transit.","I am Bolivia's seat of government high in the Andes.","The snowy peak Illimani appears beyond my skyline."],[]],["Luang Prabang","World Cities",["Morning rituals are woven into my streets.","Colonial architecture stands alongside Buddhist temples.","Two rivers meet beside my historic center.","I am a UNESCO-listed town in northern Laos.","The Mekong River runs past my many monasteries."],[]],["Borobudur","Historic Landmarks",["Pilgrims follow a symbolic upward journey through my design.","Stone reliefs tell religious and moral stories.","My monument rises in tiers above a tropical landscape.","I am a large Buddhist temple complex in central Java.","Hundreds of Buddha statues sit among my bell-shaped stupas."],[]],["Angkor Thom","Historic Landmarks",["A walled city once enclosed a powerful royal center.","My gateways carry large sculpted faces.","My temples reflect the height of a Southeast Asian empire.","I lie near Siem Reap in Cambodia.","The Bayon temple with its many serene stone faces stands at my center."],[]],["Alhambra","Historic Landmarks",["Water and gardens are central to my design.","My interiors are famous for intricate geometric decoration.","I began as a palace and fortress complex.","I overlook the Spanish city of Granada.","The Nasrid Palaces and the Court of the Lions are found here."],[]],["Sagrada Família","Historic Landmarks",["Construction has continued across generations.","My design draws on forms found in nature.","Tall spires rise above a dense Mediterranean city.","My architect's unfinished vision continues to reshape a Mediterranean skyline.","My sculptural façades depict the Nativity and Passion."],[]],["Meteora","Historic Landmarks",["Monastic life developed in a dramatic elevated setting.","My structures sit atop towering natural rock columns.","Visitors climb or travel winding paths to reach historic religious communities.","I am a UNESCO site in central Greece.","Eastern Orthodox monasteries perch on my sandstone pillars."],[]],["Mont Saint-Michel","Historic Landmarks",["Tides dramatically change access to my surroundings.","A medieval religious settlement rises above a small island.","A modern bridge links me with the mainland across tidal flats.","I am in Normandy, France.","A prominent abbey crowns my rocky tidal island."],[]],["Mesa Verde","Historic Landmarks",["Communities made remarkable use of sheltered cliffs.","Stone rooms remain tucked into natural rock alcoves.","My ruins preserve the architecture of ancestral Pueblo peoples.","I am a national park in southwestern Colorado.","Cliff Palace is my largest famous cliff dwelling."],[]],["Sigiriya","Historic Landmarks",["Royal ambition reshaped a dramatic rocky outcrop.","Water gardens and frescoes remain among my features.","A palace and fortress occupied an elevated summit.","I am an ancient citadel in Sri Lanka.","A staircase once passed between enormous lion paws."],[]],["Pompeii","Historic Landmarks",["An ordinary day was preserved through sudden disaster.","Streets and household spaces reveal ancient daily routines.","Volcanic material buried my buildings for centuries.","I was an ancient Roman town near Naples.","Mount Vesuvius erupted and engulfed me in AD 79."],[]],["Himeji Castle","Historic Landmarks",["Defensive architecture determines my twisting approaches.","My brilliant pale exterior makes me visible from afar.","I represent a well-preserved example of Japanese feudal fortification.","I stand in Hyōgo Prefecture, Japan.","I am nicknamed the White Heron Castle."],[]],["Giant's Causeway","Natural Landmarks",["Repeated geometric forms make me look deliberately constructed.","Cooling lava created the patterns beneath visitors' feet.","My stones form interlocking dark columns.","I lie on the coast of Northern Ireland.","Thousands of basalt columns extend toward the sea here."],[]],["Salar de Uyuni","Natural Landmarks",["My surface can appear almost perfectly reflective after rain.","I spread across a vast high-altitude basin.","Mineral deposits create an unusually flat landscape.","My vast white surface can merge visually with the sky after rainfall.","During the wet season, I can look like an immense mirror."],[]],["Ha Long Bay","Natural Landmarks",["Water has worn away exposed rock over enormous spans of time.","Hundreds of islands create a maze-like coastal landscape.","Steep limestone towers rise directly from the sea.","I lie in northeastern Vietnam.","Junks and tourist boats sail among my karst islands."],[]],["Pamukkale","Natural Landmarks",["Mineral-rich water has built terraces over centuries.","My bright surface resembles a frozen cascade.","Ancient visitors used nearby thermal pools.","I am a natural site in southwestern Turkey.","White travertine pools cascade below the ruins of Hierapolis."],[]],["Zhangjiajie","Natural Landmarks",["Tall rock pillars emerge through mist and forests.","Erosion shaped many isolated sandstone columns.","My dramatic scenery inspired artists and filmmakers.","I am a protected landscape in China's Hunan Province.","My quartz-sandstone pillars are associated with Avatar's floating mountains."],[]],["Jeju Island","Natural Landmarks",["My landscape reflects a volcanic origin.","Lava tubes and coastal cliffs attract explorers.","I combine mild coastal scenery with a prominent central peak.","I belong to South Korea, south of the mainland.","Hallasan volcano rises above my beaches and villages."],[]],["Socotra","Natural Landmarks",["Isolation allowed unusual species to evolve here.","My landscape looks unlike many places nearby.","Distinctive umbrella-shaped trees are an icon of my environment.","I am an island in the Arabian Sea belonging to Yemen.","Dragon's blood trees are famous features of my flora."],[]],["Tsingy de Bemaraha","Natural Landmarks",["My landscape is difficult to cross without specialized routes.","Limestone weathering produced a forest of jagged rock.","Rare animals inhabit the nearby dry forests.","I am a protected reserve in western Madagascar.","My sharp karst pinnacles are known locally as tsingy."],[]],["Lake Bled","Natural Landmarks",["A small island interrupts my still water.","Mountains and forested hills frame my shores.","A medieval castle rises above one side of my basin.","I am a glacial lake in northwestern Slovenia.","A church stands on the little island at my center."],[]],["Aye-aye","Wildlife",["I spend much of my life active after dark.","My unusual anatomy helps me locate hidden food.","I tap wood and extract larvae from narrow holes.","I am a rare lemur native to Madagascar.","My extremely long middle finger helps me forage."],[]],["Saiga antelope","Wildlife",["My home includes wide open grasslands of Eurasia.","My herds migrate across long distances.","An unusual facial adaptation helps filter dusty air.","I am a critically threatened antelope of Central Asian steppes.","My large flexible nose makes me instantly recognizable."],[]],["Kakapo","Wildlife",["My lifestyle differs from that of most birds in my family.","I am active at night and nest on the ground.","I cannot fly despite having substantial wings.","I am a rare parrot native to New Zealand.","My green feathers and owl-like face distinguish me."],[]],["Quokka","Wildlife",["I am a small marsupial of coastal islands.","I often rest under vegetation during daylight hours.","My facial expression can seem unusually cheerful.","I am native to southwestern Australia.","Photographs of my seemingly smiling face became famous online."],[]],["Leafy seadragon","Wildlife",["My appearance helps me disappear among marine vegetation.","I move using small fins rather than strong bursts of speed.","Long leaf-shaped appendages camouflage my body.","I am a marine fish related to seahorses.","My leafy outline is famous in southern Australian waters."],[]],["Shoebill","Wildlife",["I spend long periods standing motionless in wetlands.","My feeding technique depends on sudden strikes.","My enormous bill is shaped like an everyday object.","I am a large African wading bird.","My shoe-shaped beak gives me my common name."],[]],["Fennec fox","Wildlife",["I survive in an environment where daytime heat is intense.","My body has adaptations for releasing heat.","I am a small nocturnal canid that hunts desert prey.","I live in the Sahara and nearby North African deserts.","My exceptionally large ears distinguish me from other foxes."],[]],["Binturong","Wildlife",["I spend considerable time moving through forest canopies.","My strong tail helps me climb.","An unusual scent associated with my species resembles a snack.","I am a Southeast Asian mammal sometimes called a bearcat.","My scent is famously compared to buttered popcorn."],[]],["Red panda","Wildlife",["I use my tail to balance and stay warm.","I spend much of my time in cool mountain forests.","Bamboo is an important part of my diet.","I live in the Himalayas and nearby Asian mountains.","My reddish fur and ringed tail are distinctive."],[]],["Maned wolf","Wildlife",["My name is misleading about my closest relatives.","Long limbs help me move through tall grass.","I am an omnivorous wild canid found in South America.","I inhabit grasslands and savannas in Brazil and nearby countries.","My tall legs and reddish coat make me look like a fox on stilts."],[]],["Glass frog","Wildlife",["My small size helps me hide near forest streams.","I lay eggs on vegetation overhanging water.","Some members of my group have translucent undersides.","I am a tropical American amphibian.","My transparent belly can reveal internal organs."],[]],["Arctic tern","Wildlife",["I cover extraordinary distances each year.","I breed far north and travel toward waters far south.","My migration gives me long exposure to summer daylight.","I am a slender seabird with a red bill.","My annual route between Arctic and Antarctic regions is among the longest."],[]],["Flying squirrel","Wildlife",["My name exaggerates an ability I don't truly possess.","I move between trees without using ordinary wing beats.","A membrane of skin helps control my movement.","I am a small nocturnal gliding rodent.","I spread my limbs to glide from tree to tree."],[]],["Tardigrade","Science & Nature",["I am tiny but remarkably resilient.","I inhabit mosses, soil and freshwater habitats.","I can enter a suspended state during extreme dryness.","I am a remarkably resilient microscopic invertebrate.","I am an eight-legged animal commonly nicknamed a water bear."],[]],["Plate tectonics","Science & Nature",["My effects unfold over enormous spans of time.","My movement reshapes mountains and ocean basins.","My boundaries can generate earthquakes and volcanoes.","I describe the motion of large sections of Earth's outer shell.","Continents slowly drift because of me."],[]],["CRISPR","Science & Nature",["My origins lie in a natural microbial defense system.","Researchers adapted me to target genetic information.","A guide molecule helps direct a cutting enzyme.","I am widely used for precision gene editing.","My name stands for clustered regularly interspaced short palindromic repeats."],[]],["Rosalind Franklin","Historical Figures",["My experiments helped reveal a hidden molecular structure.","I used a method based on the diffraction of radiation.","The pattern I recorded became a crucial scientific clue.","I produced important X-ray diffraction images of DNA.","Photo 51 is associated with my contribution to understanding the double helix."],[]],["Ibn Battuta","Historical Figures",["My journeys took me far beyond my birthplace.","I documented societies across Africa and Asia.","I traveled for decades during the medieval period.","I was a Moroccan scholar and traveler of the 1300s.","My travel account is commonly known as the Rihla."],[]],["Mary Anning","Historical Figures",["My discoveries changed how people understood ancient life.","I worked along a coast whose cliffs regularly exposed fossils.","I achieved scientific importance despite limited formal recognition.","I found major marine reptile fossils on England's Jurassic Coast.","I was a pioneering fossil collector from Lyme Regis."],[]],["Bruges","World Cities",["Waterways influenced my development as a trading center.","My streets preserve a notably medieval appearance.","Tourists often travel by boat through my canals.","I am a historic city in northwestern Belgium.","The Belfry overlooks my large market square."],[]],["Salzburg","World Cities",["My name is tied to valuable mineral trade.","A river flows through my old center beneath mountains.","Baroque architecture is central to my identity.","I am an Austrian city beside a river under limestone mountains.","Mozart was born here, and The Sound of Music was filmed around my streets."],[]],["Bergen","World Cities",["Rain and steep hills are part of my character.","Colorful merchant warehouses recall my maritime trade.","I am an important gateway to dramatic coastal landscapes.","I am a Norwegian port city surrounded by seven mountains.","Bryggen's historic wooden waterfront is my best-known district."],[]],["Bologna","World Cities",["Students have shaped my culture for centuries.","Covered walkways extend through much of my city.","My culinary reputation is famous far beyond my region.","I am an Italian city and home to one of Europe's oldest universities.","Two leaning medieval towers rise in my historic center."],[]],["Fez","World Cities",["Artisans practice crafts in narrow old streets.","My historic quarters are known for complex alleyways.","Traditional leather workshops are a celebrated sight.","I am an ancient Moroccan city famous for its medina.","The Al-Qarawiyyin institution of learning is located here."],[]],["Antigua Guatemala","World Cities",["Volcanic peaks rise around my historic streets.","Earthquakes changed my role as a political center.","Colonial-era churches and ruins line cobblestone roads.","Ruined churches and a yellow arch recall my era as a colonial capital.","My distinctive yellow Santa Catalina Arch frames a distant volcano."],[]],["Gdańsk","World Cities",["Shipbuilding and trade have shaped my fortunes.","My waterfront buildings recall a prosperous merchant past.","A political movement tied to workers emerged in my region.","I am a Polish city on the Baltic coast.","Solidarity's origins are associated with my historic shipyard."],[]],["Córdoba Argentina","World Cities",["Education gives me an important national role.","Colonial churches stand beside modern neighborhoods.","I lie in a productive interior region far from the sea.","I am one of Argentina's largest cities.","My historic Jesuit Block is a UNESCO heritage site."],[]],["Tbilisi","World Cities",["Hot springs shaped my early settlement.","My architecture combines influences from several neighboring regions.","Balconies overlook a river valley through my center.","I am a capital in the Caucasus where trade routes once met.","Sulfur baths and Narikala Fortress stand in Georgia's capital."],[]],["Jaipur","World Cities",["A planned street grid distinguishes my old center.","My walls and palaces reflect a former royal state.","A warm hue gave me an enduring nickname.","An ornate five-story façade was designed so royal women could watch street life.","The Hawa Mahal is known for its many small windows."],[]],["Udaipur","World Cities",["Water and palaces shape my appeal.","An old royal dynasty ruled this desert-region center.","White marble buildings overlook large artificial lakes.","Several palaces rise on islands or the shores of my artificial lakes.","The Lake Palace sits within Lake Pichola."],[]],["Arequipa","World Cities",["A pale volcanic stone defines much of my historic architecture.","Mountains and volcanoes rise around my valley.","My colonial-era religious complex contains vivid courtyards.","I am a major city in southern Peru.","The Santa Catalina Monastery is a celebrated landmark."],[]],["Tromsø","World Cities",["My winters bring long periods without sunrise.","I am a starting point for trips into northern polar landscapes.","The aurora is an attraction during the darkest months.","I am a Norwegian city above the Arctic Circle.","The Arctic Cathedral stands beside a striking bridge here."],[]],["Banff","World Towns",["Rail tourism contributed to my early popularity.","Pine forests and high peaks surround my community.","Hot springs helped bring visitors into my valley.","My hot springs and Rocky Mountain scenery first attracted railway-era visitors.","I lie inside the national park bearing my name in the Canadian Rockies."],[]],["Queenstown New Zealand","World Towns",["I draw visitors seeking adventure and mountain scenery.","A large glacial lake stretches beside my town.","Outdoor sports bring travelers in all seasons.","I lie on New Zealand's South Island.","Lake Wakatipu and the Remarkables frame my surroundings."],[]],["Rovinj","World Towns",["Narrow lanes climb toward a hilltop church.","My old center was once a small island.","Fishing and maritime commerce influenced my architecture.","I am a coastal town on Croatia's Istrian Peninsula.","St. Euphemia's church rises over my red-roofed peninsula."],[]],["Chefchaouen","World Towns",["My old quarter is famous for a particular color.","Mountain slopes create a dramatic backdrop.","The streets attract photographers from around the world.","I am a town in northern Morocco's Rif Mountains.","Many of my medina's buildings are painted blue."],[]],["Ouro Preto","World Towns",["A precious metal gave me my original prosperity.","Stone streets climb hills between ornate churches.","My architecture recalls colonial Brazil's mining era.","Ornate colonial churches reflect the wealth of a former gold-mining center.","Baroque sculptor Aleijadinho worked on churches in this region."],[]],["Hallstatt","World Towns",["A natural resource supported settlement here for millennia.","My buildings cluster between steep slopes and water.","Traditional wooden houses face a narrow alpine lake.","I am a village in Austria's Salzkammergut region.","Ancient salt mines are associated with my history."],[]],["Sibiu","World Towns",["Merchant guilds helped shape my medieval core.","Several rooftops seem to stare at passersby.","Fortified squares preserve traditions from central Europe.","Old rooftops here have small openings that resemble watchful eyes.","My houses are famous for small eye-shaped roof windows."],[]],["Bukhara","Historic Landmarks",["My history is linked to trade across central Asia.","Religious schools and brick minarets form part of my urban heritage.","My old quarter preserves architecture from many Islamic dynasties.","A historic minaret rises above trading domes and Islamic schools.","The Kalyan Minaret dominates my historic center."],[]],["Sukhothai","Historic Landmarks",["Ruins preserve an early Southeast Asian royal capital.","Lotus ponds surround brick and stone monuments.","My temples reflect the growth of a regional Buddhist tradition.","I am a historic park in Thailand.","The famous seated Buddha of Wat Mahathat is among my remains."],[]],["Carcassonne","Historic Landmarks",["Walls and towers dominate my silhouette.","Fortifications were restored after centuries of change.","My winding medieval streets attract visitors from afar.","Two concentric rings of battlements surround my medieval center.","Two rings of ramparts surround my famous citadel."],[]],["Rani ki Vav","Historic Landmarks",["My architecture was built downward rather than upward.","Sculpted galleries descend through several levels.","Water storage and sacred art are combined here.","I am an elaborate stepwell in Gujarat, India.","My stepped structure was built on the banks of the Saraswati River."],[]],["Lalibela","Historic Landmarks",["Religious buildings were carved rather than assembled.","Pilgrimage remains central to my living heritage.","Rock-cut spaces connect through trenches and passageways.","I am a historic Ethiopian town.","My monolithic churches include the cross-shaped Bete Giyorgis."],[]],["Bagan","Historic Landmarks",["Brick monuments spread across a broad plain.","A powerful kingdom built many religious structures here.","Sunrise views show numerous temple silhouettes.","I am an ancient archaeological region in Myanmar.","Thousands of Buddhist pagodas rise above my landscape."],[]],["Aït Benhaddou","Historic Landmarks",["Earthen buildings rise on a rocky slope.","Caravan trade shaped my fortified settlement.","My architecture uses traditional southern Moroccan construction.","I am a historic ksar in Morocco.","Film productions often use my walled desert village as a setting."],[]],["Ephesus","Historic Landmarks",["Trade routes once connected my streets to the sea.","Stone façades reveal the scale of an ancient city.","A grand library and theater remain important attractions.","I am a Greek and Roman archaeological site in western Turkey.","The Library of Celsus stands among my ruins."],[]],["Leptis Magna","Historic Landmarks",["My fortunes rose with an expanding ancient empire.","Columns and large civic spaces survive near the coast.","One ruler spent wealth enlarging my public buildings.","I am a Roman archaeological site in Libya.","Septimius Severus was born here and later became emperor."],[]],["Hampi","Historic Landmarks",["Enormous boulders dot the landscape around my ruins.","Markets and temples recall a once-prosperous royal capital.","My buildings represent a powerful South Indian dynasty.","I am a UNESCO site in Karnataka, India.","The stone chariot of the Vittala Temple is a well-known feature."],[]],["Lençóis Maranhenses","Natural Landmarks",["My landscape changes with seasonal rainfall.","Bright sandy ridges create patterns extending toward the coast.","Freshwater pools collect between wind-shaped dunes.","I am a national park in northeastern Brazil.","My white dunes and turquoise lagoons create an unusual scene."],[]],["Wadi Rum","Natural Landmarks",["My scenery has served as a stand-in for another planet.","Sandstone towers rise from a red desert floor.","Ancient inscriptions testify to travelers over centuries.","I am a protected desert in southern Jordan.","Film crews often use my landscape to portray Mars."],[]],["Plitvice Lakes","Natural Landmarks",["Water reshapes the paths it follows through me.","Mineral deposits form natural barriers between pools.","Wooden paths pass over clear cascading water.","Natural limestone barriers divide my lakes into cascades of many colors.","My chain of turquoise lakes is connected by numerous waterfalls."],[]],["Jiuzhaigou","Natural Landmarks",["My waters can appear blue, green or turquoise.","High mountains shelter alpine lakes and forests.","Waterfalls and mineral-rich pools create striking patterns.","I am a protected valley in Sichuan, China.","My name refers to nine Tibetan villages."],[]],["Sossusvlei","Natural Landmarks",["Extreme dryness helps preserve dramatic shapes.","Some of my dunes are among the highest on Earth.","Dead trees stand against pale clay and orange sand nearby.","I am a salt and clay pan in Namibia's Namib Desert.","Deadvlei and towering red dunes are associated with my landscape."],[]],["Chocolate Hills","Natural Landmarks",["My landforms form a remarkably regular pattern.","Seasonal vegetation changes their apparent color.","Hundreds of rounded mounds cover a tropical island.","I am a famous natural attraction in the Philippines.","My symmetrical hills rise across the island of Bohol."],[]],["Aoraki Mount Cook","Natural Landmarks",["Glaciers descend from my mountain slopes.","My summit attracts climbers in a southern alpine range.","I carry both an Indigenous and an English name.","My highest ridges rise above glaciers in a southern alpine range.","I am New Zealand's highest mountain, in the Southern Alps."],[]],["Lake Natron","Natural Landmarks",["My waters contain unusually high concentrations of dissolved minerals.","The surrounding landscape is hot and arid.","My chemistry makes the water difficult for many animals.","I am a salt lake in northern Tanzania.","Lesser flamingos breed near my alkaline waters."],[]],["Mount Roraima","Natural Landmarks",["My flat top stands above surrounding lowlands.","Cliffs isolate unique plants and animals on my summit.","I am part of a chain of ancient sandstone table mountains.","I rise near the borders of Venezuela, Brazil and Guyana.","My tepui plateau inspired fictional lost-world landscapes."],[]],["Torres del Paine","Natural Landmarks",["Ice, water and mountains define my landscape.","Wildlife moves through windswept plains below snowfields.","Three stone peaks dominate well-known trekking routes.","Three great granite towers rise above windswept Patagonian terrain.","My granite towers rise above turquoise glacial lakes."],[]],["Fossa","Wildlife",["My long tail helps me move through forest branches.","I hunt animals that live high in trees.","I resemble a cat but belong to a different carnivore family.","I am native to Madagascar.","I am the island's largest native mammalian predator."],[]],["Numbat","Wildlife",["I spend much of my day searching for tiny insects.","My tongue is long and sticky.","I am a small striped marsupial with an unusual diet.","I inhabit woodlands in southwestern Australia.","I feed almost entirely on termites."],[]],["Pudu","Wildlife",["My small stature is an adaptation to dense vegetation.","I browse leaves and shoots near the forest floor.","I am a shy South American hoofed mammal.","I belong to the deer family and live in temperate forests.","I am among the smallest deer species in the world."],[]],["Markhor","Wildlife",["My agility helps me climb steep mountain slopes.","I live in rugged areas across parts of Central and South Asia.","Males carry spectacular twisting horns.","I am a wild goat found in Pakistan and nearby countries.","My corkscrew-shaped horns give me a distinctive silhouette."],[]],["Takin","Wildlife",["My build helps me move through cold mountain habitats.","I am a large hoofed animal with a thick coat.","My appearance combines features that resemble goats and cattle.","I inhabit the eastern Himalayas and nearby mountains.","I am the national animal of Bhutan."],[]],["Gerenuk","Wildlife",["My long neck helps me reach food above ground level.","I live in dry scrubland and woodland areas.","I often stand upright on my hind legs to browse.","I am an antelope of eastern Africa.","My nickname means giraffe-necked gazelle."],[]],["Dhole","Wildlife",["My groups cooperate while hunting.","I use whistling sounds among my vocal calls.","I am a reddish wild canine found in Asian forests.","I live in packs in parts of South and Southeast Asia.","I am sometimes called the Asiatic wild dog."],[]],["Serval","Wildlife",["I hunt small animals in tall grass.","My sensitive hearing helps me locate hidden prey.","I am a slender spotted feline with unusually long legs.","I live in African savannas and wetlands.","My large ears and short tail distinguish me from a cheetah."],[]],["Kinkajou","Wildlife",["I spend most of my life in trees after dark.","My tail helps me grip branches.","I feed heavily on fruit and nectar despite belonging to the carnivore order.","I inhabit tropical forests of Central and South America.","I am also called a honey bear."],[]],["Tuatara","Wildlife",["I belong to a reptile lineage much older than most modern lizards.","My growth and metabolism are relatively slow.","I have a light-sensitive organ beneath the skin of my head.","I am endemic to New Zealand.","I am the last living representative of the order Rhynchocephalia."],[]],["Okonomiyaki","Food & Cuisine",["My name suggests choosing ingredients according to taste.","I cook on a flat heated surface.","Cabbage is a central ingredient in my batter.","I am a savory pancake from Japan.","Osaka and Hiroshima have famous regional versions of me."],[]],["Feijoada","Food & Cuisine",["My cooking time allows flavors to deepen.","My ingredients reflect a history of cultural exchange.","Rice and citrus are common companions when I am served.","I am a stew featuring beans and cuts of pork.","I am strongly associated with Brazilian cuisine."],[]],["Borscht","Food & Cuisine",["I can be eaten warm or chilled.","My color often becomes unusually vivid.","Sour cream is sometimes added just before serving.","Beetroot is the ingredient most associated with me.","I am a traditional soup of eastern European cuisines, especially Ukraine."],[]],["Tagine","Food & Cuisine",["My name applies both to food and its vessel.","Slow cooking helps tenderize my ingredients.","Spices and preserved fruit can give me complex flavors.","I cook in a distinctive pot with a conical lid.","I am closely associated with Moroccan and North African cooking."],[]],["Mochi","Food & Cuisine",["My texture comes from a particular preparation of grain.","I can be filled with sweet or savory ingredients.","My chewy consistency makes me distinctive.","I am made from pounded glutinous rice.","I am a traditional Japanese rice cake."],[]],["Arepas","Food & Cuisine",["A simple grain dough forms my base.","I can be split and filled after cooking.","My crust may become crisp while the center remains tender.","I am a round cornmeal cake cooked on a griddle.","I am popular in Colombia and Venezuela."],[]],["Poutine","Food & Cuisine",["My ingredients combine a crispy base with a rich topping.","Cheese provides contrast as it softens in heat.","A savory sauce ties the dish together.","French fries, cheese curds and gravy make up my classic form.","I originated in the Canadian province of Quebec."],[]],["Jollof rice","Food & Cuisine",["Competition over recipes is part of my cultural story.","My orange-red color comes from a seasoned cooking base.","I often accompany grilled meat or chicken.","Rice cooks in a tomato-and-pepper sauce.","I am a celebrated West African dish, especially in Nigeria and Ghana."],[]],["Injera","Food & Cuisine",["My surface is filled with many small holes.","A fermented batter gives me a tangy flavor.","I am used as both food and an eating utensil.","I am a spongy flatbread traditionally made with teff.","I am central to Ethiopian and Eritrean meals."],[]],["Laksa","Food & Cuisine",["Spices perfume my broth or sauce.","Noodles and fresh herbs create contrasting textures.","Some varieties emphasize coconut while others favor sour flavors.","I am a spicy noodle soup of Southeast Asia.","I am especially associated with Malaysia and Singapore."],[]],["Gumbo","Food & Cuisine",["My thickness can come from several traditional ingredients.","I bring together cooking influences from different cultures.","A dark roux is common in many versions.","I am a hearty stew that may include okra and seafood.","I am closely associated with Louisiana Creole and Cajun cooking."],[]],["Pierogi","Food & Cuisine",["My filling can be savory or sweet.","My edges are sealed before cooking.","I am often served with butter or fried onions.","I am a stuffed dumpling frequently filled with potatoes or cheese.","I am strongly associated with Polish cuisine."],[]],["Aurora borealis","Science & Nature",["I appear when events far beyond Earth influence the night sky.","My shapes can shift rapidly across the darkness.","My colors result from particles exciting gases high above us.","I am often visible at high northern latitudes.","I am the northern lights."],[]],["Superconductivity","Science & Nature",["An ordinary property disappears in special conditions.","My behavior depends on quantum effects.","Some materials exhibit me when cooled sufficiently.","Electrical resistance falls to zero in my distinctive state.","Magnetic levitation demonstrations can use my properties."],[]],["Doppler effect","Science & Nature",["An observer's motion changes how a signal is received.","I can affect both visible light and sound.","Approaching sources and receding sources appear different.","I describe shifts in perceived frequency due to relative motion.","A passing siren changes pitch because of me."],[]],["Quantum entanglement","Science & Nature",["My behavior challenges ordinary intuitions about separate objects.","Two systems can share a joint description despite their separation.","Measurements show correlations that classical explanations cannot reproduce.","I am a phenomenon in quantum physics involving correlated particles.","My unusual correlations feature in tests of Bell inequalities."],[]],["Dark matter","Science & Nature",["My presence is inferred rather than directly seen.","My influence appears in the behavior of very large systems.","I do not emit or absorb light in the ordinary way.","My gravity helps explain how galaxies rotate and cluster.","I am the unseen component estimated to make up much of the universe's matter."],[]],["Gravitational waves","Science & Nature",["I travel across the universe without needing a medium.","My effects are extremely small when they reach Earth.","Violent cosmic events can create me.","I am ripples in spacetime predicted by general relativity.","LIGO first directly detected me from merging black holes in 2015."],[]],["Ocean acidification","Science & Nature",["My cause is connected to changes far above the water.","My effects are especially important to organisms building hard structures.","I alter a chemical balance throughout marine systems.","Absorbed carbon dioxide lowers the pH of seawater.","I threaten corals and shell-forming organisms."],[]],["Coral bleaching","Science & Nature",["My visible change signals biological stress.","A partnership between different organisms is disrupted.","Warm water can trigger my widespread occurrence.","Corals lose the symbiotic algae that give them much of their color.","Severe marine heatwaves can cause large-scale reef whitening."],[]],["El Niño Southern Oscillation","Science & Nature",["My shifts affect places far from their source.","Ocean and atmosphere interact in a repeating pattern.","I can change rainfall and storm patterns across continents.","I involve alternating warm and cool phases in the tropical Pacific.","My best-known phases are El Niño and La Niña."],[]],["Thermohaline circulation","Science & Nature",["My motion happens on a global scale.","Density differences help drive me.","Temperature and salt concentration shape my pathways.","I describe deep-ocean circulation driven by density differences.","I am sometimes called the ocean's global conveyor belt."],[]],["Ribosome","Science & Nature",["I am found in almost every living cell.","My function involves reading encoded instructions.","I link small building blocks into longer chains.","I use encoded instructions to assemble chains of smaller molecular units.","I translate messenger RNA into protein chains inside cells."],[]],["Messenger RNA","Science & Nature",["I am temporary but carry consequential instructions.","My sequence is read inside a living cell.","I help connect stored genetic information to protein production.","I carry a genetic message from DNA to a ribosome.","Some vaccines deliver my instructions to cells."],[]],["LiDAR","Inventions & Technology",["I help machines describe surroundings without touching them.","My signals travel extremely quickly to nearby surfaces.","Distance can be inferred from the time between emission and return.","I use laser pulses to create detailed 3D maps.","Autonomous vehicles and surveyors use me to measure their environment."],[]],["Lithium-ion battery","Energy & Engineering",["My components transfer charged particles during operation.","My performance helped reshape portable electronics.","My electrodes store energy through reversible chemical reactions.","I am a rechargeable energy-storage device used in phones and electric cars.","My name refers to a light metal whose ions move between electrodes."],[]],["Hydroelectric dam","Energy & Engineering",["My usefulness depends on a natural cycle far larger than myself.","Water height creates a source of potential energy.","I release flowing water through machinery to generate electricity.","I am a large engineered structure that harnesses a river.","My turbines turn the power of moving water into electrical energy."],[]],["Geothermal energy","Energy & Engineering",["I am available even when wind and sunlight are absent.","The temperature difference beneath the ground can be exploited.","My heat may provide electricity or warm buildings.","I come from thermal energy stored inside Earth.","Hot underground water and steam are common sources of me."],[]],["Desalination","Energy & Engineering",["I can make otherwise unsuitable water useful.","My processes require separating dissolved substances from a liquid.","Coastal regions often invest in me where freshwater is scarce.","I remove salts from seawater or brackish water.","Reverse osmosis and distillation are common methods of mine."],[]],["Reverse osmosis","Energy & Engineering",["My process works against a tendency for water to balance concentrations.","I use a physical barrier to separate certain dissolved substances.","Pressure drives my key step.","Water passes through a semipermeable membrane while many salts are rejected.","I am widely used in water purification and desalination."],[]],["Artificial neural network","Computing & Networks",["My structure is inspired loosely by biological systems.","Training adjusts many internal numerical parameters.","Layered calculations allow me to recognize complex patterns.","I am a machine-learning model built from connected computational units.","Deep learning systems often contain many layers of me."],[]],["Blockchain","Computing & Networks",["A shared record can be maintained without one central editor.","Changing older entries becomes difficult when later records depend on them.","My structure links records using cryptographic information.","I am a distributed ledger composed of linked blocks.","I am a technology associated with cryptocurrencies and decentralized systems."],[]],["Public-key cryptography","Computing & Networks",["My design allows communication between parties who haven't exchanged a secret.","Mathematical problems protect information during transmission.","Two related keys have different roles in my schemes.","One key can encrypt or verify while a different private key decrypts or signs.","I underpin secure online communication and digital signatures."],[]],["Semaphore","Computing & Networks",["My purpose is to coordinate work among participants.","I can signal when a resource is in use.","My value controls how many tasks may proceed.","I am a synchronization mechanism used in concurrent programming.","Operating systems use me to manage access to shared resources."],[]],["Turing machine","Computing & Networks",["My simplicity contrasts with what I can theoretically express.","I operate according to explicit rules and a changing state.","Symbols on a tape can be read, written and moved past a head.","I am a mathematical model of computation involving a tape and a control unit.","My name honors a foundational twentieth-century computer scientist."],[]],["Vacuum tube","Computing & Networks",["My technology predates compact solid-state electronics.","Early communications devices relied on my ability to control current.","Electrons travel through a nearly airless enclosed space inside me.","I can amplify or switch electrical signals.","Early computers and radios used many of me."],[]],["Integrated circuit","Computing & Networks",["I allow many electronic functions to occupy little space.","My development made compact and affordable devices possible.","Tiny components are manufactured together on one substrate.","I combine transistors and connections within a semiconductor chip.","I am sometimes called a microchip."],[]],["Microprocessor","Computing & Networks",["My invention helped place sophisticated control into everyday devices.","My architecture follows programmed instructions at great speed.","I combine the main computing functions on a compact chip.","I am the central processing unit implemented as an integrated circuit.","My role in personal computers is often described as the CPU."],[]],["OLED","Computing & Networks",["My pixels need not rely on a separate backlight.","My construction enables exceptionally thin display panels.","Organic materials emit light when electrically stimulated.","I am a display technology used in televisions and smartphones.","My initials refer to an organic light-emitting diode."],[]],["E-ink","Computing & Networks",["My appearance resembles printed paper more than a glowing display.","I use relatively little energy when showing a static image.","Tiny charged particles change position to form visible text.","I am a reflective display technology commonly used in e-readers.","Electronic paper is another name for my technology."],[]],["Radar","Computing & Networks",["I allow objects to be detected when visibility is poor.","Signals travel away from a device and return after reflection.","Timing and frequency changes can reveal motion and distance.","I use radio waves to locate objects.","Air-traffic systems and weather forecasters rely on me."],[]],["Sonar","Computing & Networks",["I am especially useful in an environment where light travels poorly.","I detect objects using reflected signals.","My method measures the travel time of waves through a medium.","I use sound to find objects underwater.","Ships and submarines use me for depth finding and navigation."],[]],["Satellite navigation","Computing & Networks",["My accuracy depends on precise timing.","Signals arrive from objects far above the surface.","Receivers estimate position by comparing multiple transmissions.","I determine location using orbiting transmitters.","Modern mapping apps rely on systems such as GPS that use me."],[]],["Autopilot","Computing & Networks",["My role is to reduce routine manual control.","Sensors and feedback systems guide my adjustments.","I can hold a course or altitude as conditions change.","I am an automatic control system used in aircraft and ships.","Pilots use me to maintain flight parameters during long journeys."],[]],["Air traffic control","Computing & Networks",["My work depends on coordination rather than propulsion.","Communication and surveillance help manage complex routes.","I separate vehicles to reduce collision risk.","I organize aircraft movements on the ground and in controlled airspace.","Controllers clear pilots for takeoff, landing and safe flight paths."],[]],["Vulcanized rubber","Materials Science",["My useful properties depend on changing a natural material chemically.","My process makes elasticity more stable across temperatures.","Cross-links form between long polymer chains.","Sulfur treatment improves my strength and durability.","My development is strongly associated with Charles Goodyear."],[]],["Carbon fiber","Materials Science",["I can be both strong and unusually light.","Thousands of tiny filaments can form a single tow.","My material is often embedded in a resin matrix.","I am made from thin strands primarily composed of carbon.","Aircraft, racing bikes and sports equipment use my composites."],[]],["Graphene","Materials Science",["One thin layer can still have impressive strength.","My geometry repeats a familiar hexagonal pattern.","Electrons move through me in unusual ways.","I am a single layer of carbon atoms arranged in a honeycomb.","I can be isolated from graphite using adhesive tape."],[]],["Aerogel","Materials Science",["My volume is mostly empty space.","My lightness contrasts with a solid's appearance.","A gel's liquid component is replaced with gas.","I am an extremely low-density porous material.","My silica form is sometimes nicknamed frozen smoke."],[]],["Silicon wafer","Materials Science",["My flat surface supports microscopic manufacturing.","My uniformity is essential for precision processes.","Many circuits can be formed across me before cutting.","I am a thin disc of semiconductor material.","Computer chips are often fabricated on my surface."],[]],["Semiconductor","Materials Science",["My behavior lies between that of two familiar electrical extremes.","Small changes can greatly alter how charge travels through me.","Doping modifies my electrical properties.","I am a material whose conductivity can be controlled.","Silicon is a common example used in electronic devices."],[]],["Perovskite solar cell","Materials Science",["Researchers study my efficiency and long-term stability.","My active layer can be processed at relatively low temperatures.","My crystal structure belongs to a particular mineral family.","I am an emerging photovoltaic technology.","I convert sunlight using light-absorbing materials with a perovskite structure."],[]],["Optical fiber","Materials Science",["My signal can travel long distances with low loss.","My core guides light along a flexible path.","Total internal reflection keeps much of that light confined.","I am a thin strand of glass or plastic used to transmit information.","Modern telecommunications networks depend heavily on me."],[]],["JPEG","Computing & Networks",["My design makes large visual files easier to store and send.","I trade some detail for a smaller amount of data.","My compression is especially common with photographic images.","I am a widely used lossy image format.","My file extension often ends in .jpg."],[]],["MP3","Computing & Networks",["My format helped make portable audio libraries practical.","My coding removes some information unlikely to be noticed.","A smaller file can still contain recognizable recorded sound.","I am a digital audio compression format.","My three-character name became associated with early music players."],[]],["HTTP","Computing & Networks",["My exchanges commonly involve requests and responses.","I organize communication between clients and servers.","I define methods for obtaining or sending resources.","I am the application protocol used by much of the World Wide Web.","My abbreviation stands for Hypertext Transfer Protocol."],[]],["DNS","Computing & Networks",["I help users avoid memorizing numerical addresses.","My information is distributed across many servers.","A lookup translates a memorable name into network information.","I map domain names to records such as IP addresses.","My acronym stands for Domain Name System."],[]],["Cloud computing","Computing & Networks",["My resources can expand without a customer owning every machine.","Remote infrastructure makes services available on demand.","I commonly use virtualization and distributed data centers.","I deliver computing resources over the internet.","Online storage and hosted servers are examples of me."],[]],["Quantum computer","Computing & Networks",["My behavior depends on unusual rules of microscopic physics.","I can represent and manipulate states differently from classical systems.","Noise and error correction remain major engineering challenges.","I use qubits rather than only ordinary binary bits.","Superposition and entanglement can play roles in my computation."],[]],["Internet of Things","Computing & Networks",["Everyday objects become part of a larger network.","Sensors collect measurements and report them remotely.","Devices can exchange information without direct human interaction.","I describe connected physical objects embedded with software and sensors.","Smart thermostats and connected appliances are examples of me."],[]],["Biometric authentication","Computing & Networks",["My goal is to verify identity without relying solely on memorized information.","My input comes from characteristics of a person.","A stored template can be compared with a new measurement.","I use fingerprints, faces or other human traits for verification.","Phones often let users unlock with me."],[]],["DNA fingerprinting","Scientific Methods",["Small biological traces can reveal surprising information.","My patterns differ across individuals except in special cases.","Laboratories compare selected regions of genetic material.","I use DNA profiles to help identify people.","Forensic investigations and paternity testing use me."],[]],["PCR","Scientific Methods",["My process repeats a short sequence of temperature changes.","I work with tiny amounts of biological material.","Specialized enzymes help copy selected genetic regions.","I amplify DNA through repeated heating and cooling cycles.","My initials stand for polymerase chain reaction."],[]],["Western blot","Scientific Methods",["My workflow separates and identifies biological molecules.","A membrane receives material transferred from a gel.","Specific binding agents reveal the target.","I detect proteins using antibodies after electrophoresis.","I am a common laboratory technique for protein analysis."],[]],["ELISA","Scientific Methods",["My results often produce a measurable color change.","A carefully chosen binding interaction determines specificity.","I can test for a particular protein or immune response.","I use enzyme-linked antibodies or antigens for detection.","My acronym stands for enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay."],[]],["Sanger sequencing","Scientific Methods",["My approach reads genetic information one position at a time.","Special molecules terminate chains during replication.","Fragments of different lengths reveal the sequence.","I am a classic method for determining DNA base order.","My name honors the biochemist who developed chain-termination sequencing."],[]],["Gene therapy","Scientific Methods",["My treatment target lies inside living cells.","Delivery is often one of my largest challenges.","My approach attempts to address a disorder at the genetic level.","I introduce, modify or replace genetic material to treat disease.","Some of my techniques use modified viruses as delivery vehicles."],[]],["Stem cells","Scientific Methods",["My descendants can take on different specialized roles.","I can replenish tissues under certain conditions.","My developmental potential varies among different types.","I am an unspecialized cell capable of self-renewal and differentiation.","Embryonic and adult forms of me are studied in regenerative medicine."],[]],["X-ray crystallography","Scientific Methods",["My results depend on patterns formed by scattered radiation.","Orderly arrangements make my method possible.","Mathematical analysis reveals arrangements on an atomic scale.","I use X-ray diffraction from crystals to infer structures.","My method was crucial to determining many proteins and DNA structures."],[]],["Electron diffraction","Scientific Methods",["My method depends on the wave behavior of particles.","A regular structure creates an interference pattern.","The resulting image helps reveal atomic arrangements.","I use electrons scattered by matter to study crystal structures.","My patterns demonstrate the wave nature of electrons."],[]],["Radiocarbon dating","Scientific Methods",["My clock relies on a natural change over time.","I compare surviving atoms with expected quantities.","My reach is especially useful for relatively recent archaeological material.","I estimate the age of once-living matter using radioactive carbon.","The isotope carbon-14 is central to me."],[]],["Dendrochronology","Scientific Methods",["My records are written by living organisms.","Changes in climate affect the patterns I study.","Matching repeating growth patterns creates a timeline.","I determine ages and past conditions from annual tree rings.","Ancient wooden structures can be dated using me."],[]],["Remote sensing","Scientific Methods",["I gather information without direct contact with the target.","Patterns in reflected or emitted energy can reveal conditions.","My equipment can travel above the ground on aircraft or satellites.","I observe Earth's surface from a distance using sensors.","Satellite images are a familiar example of me."],[]],["GIS","Scientific Methods",["I link information with places on a map.","Layers can show relationships between different kinds of data.","I help analyze patterns across geographic space.","I am a geographic information system.","Urban planners use me to combine maps, census data and land use."],[]],["Prosthetic limb","Medical Technology",["I help replace a function lost through injury or difference.","My fit and control are essential to everyday use.","Some modern versions use sensors and powered components.","I am an artificial replacement for an arm or leg.","My design can restore mobility or assist grasping."],[]],["Insulin pump","Medical Technology",["My precise doses help manage an important biological process.","I deliver medication through a small wearable system.","Some versions respond to glucose-sensor readings.","I give insulin continuously or in programmed doses.","I am used by some people living with diabetes."],[]],["Artificial heart valve","Medical Technology",["I control the direction of a flowing liquid.","My design must endure constant repeated movement.","I can be made from mechanical materials or biological tissue.","I replace a damaged valve inside the heart.","My purpose is to keep blood moving in the proper direction."],[]],["Dialysis machine","Medical Technology",["My operation substitutes for part of an organ's role.","A membrane helps separate substances from a liquid.","My process can remove excess fluid and waste products.","I filter blood when kidneys cannot function adequately.","I am central to many hemodialysis treatments."],[]],["Ventilator","Medical Technology",["I can support a process people normally do automatically.","My settings control pressure, volume and timing.","Air moves through a circuit connected to the patient.","I assist or replace breathing by delivering air into the lungs.","Hospitals use me when patients need mechanical ventilation."],[]],["Pulse oximeter","Medical Technology",["I estimate an important property without drawing blood.","Light of different wavelengths travels through tissue.","A small sensor often clips to a finger.","I estimate the oxygen saturation of blood.","My display usually shows SpO2 and pulse rate."],[]],["Robotic surgery","Medical Technology",["My instruments can translate small operator movements.","My systems can provide magnified views in confined spaces.","The human operator remains responsible for decisions.","I use computer-controlled instruments during surgical procedures.","Some hospitals use a da Vinci system for me."],[]],["Laparoscope","Medical Technology",["My narrow profile allows access through a small opening.","I carry a viewing system into the body.","My images help guide minimally invasive procedures.","I am an instrument used to look inside the abdominal cavity.","Surgeons use me in keyhole abdominal operations."],[]],["Endoscope","Medical Technology",["My design allows viewing difficult-to-reach internal spaces.","A flexible tube may carry light and a camera.","Special tools can sometimes pass through channels within me.","I help examine hollow organs without large incisions.","Gastroenterologists often use me to inspect the digestive tract."],[]],["Positron emission tomography","Medical Technology",["My images depend on signals produced inside the body.","A tracer helps reveal metabolic activity.","Detectors capture paired gamma rays from particle interactions.","I am a nuclear medical imaging technique often abbreviated PET.","I can help assess cancer, brain function and heart tissue."],[]],["ECG","Medical Technology",["My tracing records changes over time.","Several electrodes measure signals at the body's surface.","My waveform helps reveal patterns in an organ's rhythm.","I record the electrical activity of the heart.","My acronym stands for electrocardiogram."],[]],["EEG","Medical Technology",["My recordings show rapidly changing patterns.","Sensors detect tiny electrical signals through the scalp.","My results are used in sleep studies and seizure evaluation.","I record the brain's electrical activity.","My acronym stands for electroencephalogram."],[]],["Baobab","Botany & Plants",["My form makes me look unlike many other trees.","I can store substantial water in a thick trunk.","My broad crown may appear like roots reaching into the air.","Several species grow in Madagascar and mainland Africa.","My massive swollen trunk gives me the nickname upside-down tree."],[]],["Welwitschia","Botany & Plants",["My appearance changes little even over a long life.","I survive in one of the world's driest environments.","I produce only two persistent leaves that grow continuously.","I am a remarkable desert plant native to Namibia and Angola.","My long leaves become torn into ribbons as I age."],[]],["Rafflesia","Botany & Plants",["My body remains hidden for much of its life.","I depend on another plant for nutrients.","My bloom produces a strong odor that attracts insects.","My enormous bloom grows without conventional leaves, stems or roots.","I can produce one of the world's largest individual flowers."],[]],["Corpse flower","Botany & Plants",["My most famous event is brief and infrequent.","My reproductive display releases an unpleasant odor.","A towering central structure rises from a large surrounding bract.","I am a giant tropical plant from Sumatra.","My bloom is famous for smelling like rotting flesh."],[]],["Venus flytrap","Botany & Plants",["My diet supplements what poor soil cannot provide.","Specialized parts respond to repeated physical stimulation.","Small animals can trigger a rapid closing motion.","I am a carnivorous plant native to the Carolinas.","My hinged leaf traps capture insects."],[]],["Pitcher plant","Botany & Plants",["I acquire nutrients through an unusual strategy.","My modified leaves hold liquid in a deep cavity.","Slippery edges can cause small animals to fall inside.","I am a carnivorous plant with cup-shaped trapping leaves.","Insects are digested within my distinctive pitchers."],[]],["Sundew","Botany & Plants",["Tiny droplets give me a deceptive appearance.","My leaves can slowly curl around captured prey.","Sticky glandular hairs help me trap small creatures.","I am a carnivorous plant often growing in boggy soil.","My glistening sticky traps resemble drops of morning dew."],[]],["Sensitive plant","Botany & Plants",["My behavior is unusually visible to an observer.","Physical disturbance triggers changes in cell pressure.","My leaves fold rapidly when touched.","I am a tropical herb with feathery compound leaves.","I am often called the touch-me-not plant."],[]],["Resurrection plant","Botany & Plants",["I can look lifeless while retaining the potential to recover.","Severe drying changes my shape and appearance.","Water allows me to regain activity after dehydration.","I am a plant that tolerates extreme desiccation.","Some of my forms curl into a ball and reopen after rain."],[]],["Ginkgo","Botany & Plants",["My lineage reaches far back in geological history.","Modern relatives of mine have disappeared.","My distinctive leaves turn golden in autumn.","I am a deciduous tree native to China.","My fan-shaped leaves make me easy to recognize."],[]],["Giant sequoia","Botany & Plants",["My longevity is matched by tremendous mass.","Fire plays a role in parts of my natural ecology.","My bark can become unusually thick and fibrous.","I grow naturally on the western slopes of California's Sierra Nevada.","Some of my trees are among the most massive living organisms."],[]],["Coast redwood","Botany & Plants",["Mist can help sustain me through dry seasons.","My forests thrive in a narrow coastal environment.","I can grow to extraordinary heights.","I am a conifer native to the Pacific coast of North America.","I include the tallest known living trees."],[]],["Bristlecone pine","Botany & Plants",["My slow growth helps me survive severe conditions.","I live in exposed mountains where many plants struggle.","My dense wood and resin help preserve old branches.","I am a long-lived conifer of western North America.","Some individuals of my species are thousands of years old."],[]],["Dragon blood tree","Botany & Plants",["Isolation shaped my unusual appearance.","My resin has long been valued for its color.","My branches spread outward beneath a dense umbrella-shaped crown.","I grow on the island of Socotra.","My bright red resin gives me a dramatic common name."],[]],["Quiver tree","Botany & Plants",["My tall branching form stands above an arid landscape.","My trunk stores water in dry conditions.","My hollow branches were traditionally used for carrying arrows.","I am a tree-like aloe native to southern Africa.","My crown resembles a cluster of forks against the desert sky."],[]],["Saguaro","Botany & Plants",["I grow very slowly in a harsh climate.","Many animals nest or shelter in my body.","My columnar form may develop long arms.","I am a giant cactus native to the Sonoran Desert.","My iconic silhouette is associated with Arizona."],[]],["Joshua tree","Botany & Plants",["My name comes from a visual comparison made by travelers.","My branches angle upward from a twisted trunk.","I inhabit a desert region in the southwestern United States.","I am a yucca plant rather than a true tree.","A national park in California bears my name."],[]],["Agave","Botany & Plants",["My leaves store water for extended dry periods.","Sharp edges can protect my rosette from grazing animals.","Some species bloom only after many years of growth.","I am a succulent plant native mostly to the Americas.","Certain species are used to make tequila and mezcal."],[]],["Aloe vera","Botany & Plants",["My leaves contain a clear inner substance.","I thrive in warm, dry environments.","Fleshy leaves form a compact rosette.","I am a succulent plant often grown for soothing skin preparations.","My gel is a common ingredient in lotions."],[]],["Bamboo","Botany & Plants",["My growth can be remarkably rapid.","Despite my size, I belong to a family of grasses.","My hollow segmented stems support many different uses.","I grow in clumps or spreading groves across warm regions.","My culms are used in construction, furniture and scaffolding."],[]],["Banyan tree","Botany & Plants",["My form can create the appearance of a small forest.","I send additional roots downward from branches.","Those roots thicken into supporting trunks.","I am a kind of fig tree found in tropical Asia.","My spreading canopy can cover an enormous area."],[]],["Cork oak","Botany & Plants",["My outer covering can be removed without killing me.","My cultivation supports a specialized Mediterranean industry.","I develop a thick bark that grows back after harvesting.","I am an evergreen oak found around the western Mediterranean.","Bottle stoppers are commonly made from my bark."],[]],["Rubber tree","Botany & Plants",["A milky liquid flows through specialized tissues in my trunk.","My crop transformed global transport and manufacturing.","Farmers collect my product through shallow cuts in bark.","I am a tropical tree originally native to the Amazon region.","Natural latex tapped from me is used to produce rubber."],[]],["Cacao tree","Botany & Plants",["My flowers can emerge directly from the main trunk.","My fruit contains seeds valued around the world.","Warm, humid forests provide my natural growing conditions.","I am a tropical tree native to the Americas.","The beans in my pods are processed into chocolate."],[]],["Coffee plant","Botany & Plants",["My small fruits change color as they mature.","The commercial value lies primarily in the seeds.","My cultivation often benefits from mild tropical highland climates.","I am a shrub or small tree originally from tropical Africa.","Roasted seeds from my cherries are used to brew a popular drink."],[]],["Tea plant","Botany & Plants",["Different processing methods yield strikingly different products.","My leaves are harvested from managed evergreen shrubs.","Oxidation affects the character of many finished varieties.","Processing my evergreen leaves differently creates several familiar drinks.","Green, black and oolong beverages all come from my leaves."],[]],["Vanilla orchid","Botany & Plants",["My crop needs careful handling after harvesting.","My flowers are often pollinated by hand in cultivation.","Long seed pods develop after successful pollination.","I am a climbing tropical orchid originating in Mexico.","My cured pods give a familiar sweet aroma to desserts."],[]],["Saffron crocus","Botany & Plants",["Each of my flowers contributes only a small amount of a valuable product.","Careful hand harvesting makes cultivation labor intensive.","The prized material consists of delicate red floral parts.","I am a purple-flowered crocus cultivated around the Mediterranean and Asia.","My dried stigmas are used as an expensive spice."],[]],["Lotus","Botany & Plants",["My symbolism reaches beyond my ecological role.","I often grow rooted in mud beneath still water.","Water beads easily on my unusual leaves.","My flowers rise on long stalks above muddy freshwater.","My large blossoms rise above ponds on long stalks."],[]],["Water lily","Botany & Plants",["My floating leaves spread across still water.","Aquatic animals use my shade and shelter.","My flowers open near the water's surface.","I am a freshwater aquatic plant with broad pads.","My round floating leaves are often called lily pads."],[]],["Giant water lily","Botany & Plants",["My floating leaves are unusually large.","Strong veins support my leaf surface from beneath.","My flowers can change color during their short lives.","I am a giant aquatic plant of tropical South America.","My circular leaves can grow wide enough to support small animals briefly."],[]],["Duckweed","Botany & Plants",["I reproduce rapidly under favorable conditions.","My small size lets me cover water in a green layer.","I float freely instead of growing tall stems.","I am among the smallest flowering plants.","I often appear as tiny green specks on quiet ponds."],[]],["Edelweiss","Botany & Plants",["My reputation is tied to difficult mountain environments.","Soft hairs help protect me from harsh conditions.","My pale woolly structures surround much smaller flowers.","My woolly, star-shaped floral bracts have become an alpine emblem.","I am a famous symbol of the Alps."],[]],["Bluebell","Botany & Plants",["I can transform a woodland floor during one season.","My flowers hang downward on slender stalks.","I am associated with old deciduous forests.","I bloom in spring with small bell-shaped flowers.","Large violet-blue carpets of me are famous in British woodlands."],[]],["Foxglove","Botany & Plants",["My beauty conceals potent chemical compounds.","Pollinating insects enter my tubular blossoms.","My tall stem carries many drooping flowers.","I am a flowering plant associated with woodland edges.","The heart drug digoxin is derived from compounds found in my genus."],[]],["Poinsettia","Botany & Plants",["My most noticeable display is not made from ordinary petals.","Shorter days encourage my seasonal coloration.","My colorful leaf-like bracts surround small flowers.","I am a shrub native to Mexico.","My red and green display is associated with Christmas."],[]],["Bird of paradise flower","Botany & Plants",["My bloom is shaped to attract particular visitors.","Bright structures project from a horizontal bract.","My flowers resemble the form of an exotic animal.","I am an ornamental plant native to southern Africa.","My orange-and-blue blossoms look like a bird in flight."],[]],["Protea","Botany & Plants",["My large flower heads are assembled from many small blossoms.","My group evolved across landscapes prone to fire.","My colorful bracts draw attention to my inflorescence.","I am a flowering shrub group strongly associated with South Africa.","My king species bears one of the country's national flowers."],[]],["Banksia","Botany & Plants",["My seed structures can survive harsh conditions.","Some species release seeds after intense heat.","My flower spikes attract birds and insects.","I am a plant genus native mainly to Australia.","My woody seed cones and bottlebrush-like blossoms are distinctive."],[]],["Wollemi pine","Botany & Plants",["My living relatives were once thought absent from modern forests.","My discovery surprised botanists late in the twentieth century.","I belong to an ancient family of conifers.","I survive in a remote part of New South Wales, Australia.","I was famously discovered alive in 1994."],[]],["Monkey puzzle tree","Botany & Plants",["My unusual form earned a memorable English nickname.","My stiff leaves overlap thickly along branches.","I am native to mountains of southern South America.","I am an ancient evergreen conifer from Chile and Argentina.","My sharp triangular leaves cover my limbs."],[]],["Date palm","Botany & Plants",["My fruits have supported communities in arid regions for millennia.","I tolerate hot conditions with adequate water.","I grow tall with a crown of long feather-like leaves.","I am a cultivated palm common in Middle Eastern oases.","My sweet brown fruits are often eaten dried."],[]],["Coconut palm","Botany & Plants",["My seeds can travel across ocean water.","Many parts of my body are useful to humans.","I thrive on tropical coastlines and sandy soils.","I am a tall palm that produces large fibrous fruits.","My fruit contains coconut water and white flesh."],[]],["Olive tree","Botany & Plants",["My gnarled trunks can persist for centuries.","My leaves stay green through dry Mediterranean summers.","My fruit can be pressed for a valuable oil.","I am a cultivated tree widespread around the Mediterranean.","My small green or black drupes are eaten or made into oil."],[]],["Pomegranate tree","Botany & Plants",["My flowers lead to a fruit filled with many juicy compartments.","My symbolism appears in several ancient cultures.","The seeds are surrounded by ruby-colored edible arils.","I am a small tree or shrub cultivated in warm regions.","My round red fruit opens to reveal hundreds of jewel-like arils."],[]],["Fig tree","Botany & Plants",["My unusual fruit structure hides many tiny flowers.","Some species depend on very specialized pollinating insects.","My branches produce soft sweet fruits.","I am a tree cultivated around the Mediterranean for thousands of years.","My pear-shaped fruits may have purple or green skin."],[]],["Jacaranda","Botany & Plants",["My seasonal display can change the color of an entire street.","Clusters of blossoms appear along my branches.","My foliage is finely divided and fern-like.","I am a flowering tree widely planted in warm cities.","My purple-blue blossoms are famous in South Africa and Australia."],[]],["Wisteria","Botany & Plants",["My climbing habit can cover walls and pergolas.","My flowers hang in long fragrant clusters.","I am a woody vine that may become very heavy with age.","I bloom in spring with cascading purple or white blossoms.","Japanese gardens often display my dramatic hanging flowers."],[]],["Bougainvillea","Botany & Plants",["My brightest structures are not true flower petals.","I thrive in sunny warm places and can tolerate dry spells.","My thorny branches can climb fences and walls.","I am a tropical ornamental plant with vivid papery bracts.","My purple, pink and magenta displays decorate Mediterranean walls."],[]],["Modern pentathlon","Sports & Games",["My challenge rewards versatility rather than mastery of one skill.","Competitors move between very different kinds of tests.","I originated from an imagined combination of military skills.","My traditional program included fencing, swimming, riding, running and shooting.","I am an Olympic multisport event with five disciplines."],[]],["Padel","Sports & Games",["My boundaries are part of the action, not merely limitations.","Players commonly compete in pairs.","The ball can rebound from enclosed walls during play.","I am a racket sport played on a small enclosed court.","I combine elements of tennis and squash."],[]],["Hurling","Sports & Games",["My speed requires precise hand-eye coordination.","Players strike a small ball with a wooden implement.","Goals and points are scored through different targets.","I am a traditional Irish field sport.","My stick is called a hurley and my ball a sliotar."],[]],["Gaelic football","Sports & Games",["My players use both hands and feet.","Scoring can occur above or below a crossbar.","My field is larger than a typical soccer pitch.","I am a popular Irish team field sport.","I combine kicking, catching and hand-passing a round ball."],[]],["Australian rules football","Sports & Games",["My playing field is often oval rather than rectangular.","Players must move the ball using specific forms of kicking or hand-passing.","I have tall goal posts with different scoring values.","I am a football code developed in Australia.","My highest professional league is commonly called the AFL."],[]],["Capoeira","Sports & Games",["Music is central to my practice.","My participants often move in a circle.","My movements combine sweeps, escapes and acrobatics.","I am an Afro-Brazilian cultural practice blending dance and martial arts.","A berimbau sets the rhythm for my movements."],[]],["Breaking","Sports & Games",["Creativity is as important to me as physical strength.","Performers take turns responding to one another.","Footwork, freezes and spins are among my characteristic elements.","I am a competitive dance style rooted in hip-hop culture.","I appeared as an Olympic sport at Paris 2024."],[]],["Cornhole","Sports & Games",["My equipment is simple enough for a backyard.","Players aim at a raised target from a measured distance.","A small opening provides extra points.","I am a lawn game using fabric bags and sloped boards.","Players score by landing beanbags on the board or through the hole."],[]],["Bocce","Sports & Games",["My pace is deliberate and tactical.","I am traditionally played on a long, narrow surface.","Competitors try to finish closer to a small target than opponents.","I am an Italian ball game related to lawn bowls.","My small target ball is called the pallino."],[]],["Pétanque","Sports & Games",["My players often compete on gravel or hard dirt.","Precision matters more than throwing distance.","Metal balls are aimed toward a smaller target.","I am a French boules game.","Players typically throw while standing inside a circle."],[]],["Horseshoes","Sports & Games",["My target consists of a narrow vertical object.","Accuracy determines whether the thrown equipment lands usefully.","Players score by surrounding or approaching a stake.","I am a traditional lawn game.","My equipment is U-shaped metal pieces originally associated with equine footwear."],[]],["Pool","Sports & Games",["Angles are central to success in my game.","A long stick transfers force to spherical objects.","Balls move across a cloth-covered surface with side cushions.","I am a cue sport played on a pocketed table.","Eight-ball and nine-ball are common versions of me."],[]],["Backgammon","Board Games",["Probability and strategy interact in my play.","My board features long triangular points.","Two dice determine how pieces may move.","I am a two-player game involving checkers and bearing them off a board.","My doubling cube adds decisions about stakes."],[]],["Go board game","Board Games",["My rules are simple but my strategies can be extremely deep.","Territory is an important objective.","Players alternate placing two colors of stones on intersections.","I am an ancient board game particularly associated with East Asia.","My board commonly has a nineteen-by-nineteen grid."],[]],["Shogi","Board Games",["Captured pieces need not remain out of play.","My board is divided into a regular grid.","Players promote certain pieces by advancing them.","I am a Japanese strategy game related to chess.","My distinctive rule lets players drop captured pieces back onto the board."],[]],["Mahjong","Board Games",["My equipment includes decorated pieces rather than a standard deck.","Players build combinations while concealing much of their information.","Draws and discards determine the pace of a round.","I am a traditional Chinese tile game.","A winning hand often consists of sets and a pair."],[]],["Contract bridge","Board Games",["Communication is restricted but cooperation is essential.","Players form two partnerships facing each other.","Bidding establishes a target before cards are played.","I am a trick-taking card game using a standard deck.","One partner becomes dummy after the opening lead."],[]],["Poker","Board Games",["Incomplete information shapes nearly every decision.","Players can influence others without changing their own cards.","Betting continues around a shared pot.","I am a family of card games involving wagers and hand rankings.","Texas hold'em is one of my best-known forms."],[]],["Sudoku","Board Games",["My rules require logic without arithmetic calculations.","Numbers serve as symbols rather than quantities.","Each row and column must avoid repetition.","I am a grid puzzle governed by constraints across intersecting groups.","Each row, column and three-by-three box in my nine-by-nine grid uses digits one to nine."],[]],["Crossword puzzle","Board Games",["My layout makes separate answers intersect.","Some solutions rely on wordplay rather than direct definitions.","Black squares separate many of my entries.","I am a word puzzle with across and down clues.","My answers are written into intersecting horizontal and vertical spaces."],[]],["Jigsaw puzzle","Board Games",["The big picture emerges from many separate pieces.","Shape and color help guide progress.","My pieces often have tabs and blanks.","I am a picture puzzle assembled from interlocking cut pieces.","People commonly begin by separating my edge pieces."],[]],["Tetris","Video Games",["My challenge gets harder as available space disappears.","Speed and spatial planning are central to success.","Pieces descend while players rotate and position them.","My difficulty comes from placing pieces before the playing field fills.","I am a classic game in which descending geometric shapes complete horizontal lines."],[]],["Pac-Man","Video Games",["My simple appearance became an arcade icon.","The playfield is a maze with moving hazards.","Collecting small items is the central goal.","Moving enemies patrol a maze while I try to collect targets.","My yellow circular hero eats pellets and occasionally chases ghosts."],[]],["Minecraft","Video Games",["My world is built from a simple visual unit.","Players decide whether to explore, build or survive.","Resources are gathered and combined through crafting.","I encourage open-ended exploration and survival in a modifiable world.","Creepers and blocks are hallmarks of my sandbox environment."],[]],["The Legend of Zelda","Video Games",["Exploration is central to my identity.","Players solve puzzles while navigating dangerous locations.","A recurring hero seeks to protect a fantasy kingdom.","I combine exploration, battles and puzzles across a recurring fantasy setting.","Link journeys through Hyrule to help Princess Zelda."],[]],["Super Mario Bros.","Video Games",["My levels reward timing and movement.","My hero travels through colorful environments with hidden secrets.","Enemies include walking mushrooms and turtles.","My early levels feature brick blocks, pipes and mushroom-shaped enemies.","Two plumber brothers rescue a princess from Bowser."],[]],["Sonic the Hedgehog","Video Games",["Speed is central to my design.","My hero moves through looping terrain and collects objects.","A scientist repeatedly threatens the environment.","I am a Sega platform-game series.","My blue animal protagonist collects golden rings."],[]],["Pokémon","Video Games",["My world rewards exploration and collection.","Creatures develop different abilities as they grow.","Trainers battle using companions with distinct elemental types.","I revolve around raising allies with different strengths and abilities.","Pikachu is among the creatures caught and trained in my franchise."],[]],["Pokémon GO","Video Games",["The real world provides my playing field.","Location information affects where players can find objectives.","Players walk outdoors to collect virtual creatures.","I am an augmented-reality mobile game launched in 2016.","PokéStops and gyms appear on real-world maps."],[]],["Fortnite","Video Games",["My playable world changes with seasons.","Construction was central to my original competitive identity.","Players survive against others on a shrinking map.","My competitive matches unfold in a constantly changing shared environment.","Epic Games publishes my colorful island-based battle royale."],[]],["Among Us","Video Games",["Not every participant has the same objective.","Group discussions can determine who is removed from play.","Players complete tasks while someone secretly sabotages them.","Players must distinguish allies from hidden saboteurs.","Crewmates complete tasks while impostors try to eliminate them."],[]],["League of Legends","Video Games",["Team coordination matters more than individual strength.","Players choose characters with distinct combat abilities.","Two teams seek to destroy the other side's core structure.","My teams protect structures while coordinating characters with special abilities.","Riot Games publishes my arena game whose characters are called champions."],[]],["Dota 2","Video Games",["My matches combine strategy with constant tactical decisions.","Different characters have powerful specialized abilities.","Teams defend structures while attacking an opposing base.","My teams balance powerful heroes with resource management and map control.","Valve publishes me, and my major championship is called The International."],[]],["Counter-Strike","Video Games",["Quick decisions can determine an entire round.","Players purchase equipment between rounds.","Two teams compete over objectives such as planted devices.","I am a tactical first-person shooter franchise.","My competitive matches commonly feature terrorists and counter-terrorists."],[]],["Valorant","Video Games",["My competitive design combines accurate aim with special abilities.","Teams alternate between attacking and defending.","Characters have unique powers beyond their weapons.","My rounds combine accurate gunplay with character-specific abilities.","Riot Games created me, and my playable characters are called agents."],[]],["FIFA World Cup","Sporting Events",["National pride shapes my atmosphere.","The competition unfolds over several weeks.","Qualification determines who reaches the final tournament.","I am an international men's football championship held every four years.","My trophy is awarded to the world's champion national soccer team."],[]],["Kentucky Derby","Sporting Events",["My duration is short compared with my traditions.","Large hats and spring celebrations surround my event.","I begin a famous series of three races.","I am a thoroughbred horse race run in Louisville.","My race is nicknamed the Run for the Roses."],[]],["Dakar Rally","Sporting Events",["My route requires endurance in remote environments.","Navigation can be as important as outright speed.","Motorcycles, trucks and cars compete across difficult terrain.","I am a long-distance rally-raid event.","Although named after a Senegalese city, my modern editions have run in Saudi Arabia."],[]],["Boston Marathon","Sporting Events",["My course draws elite athletes and dedicated amateurs.","A qualifying time is important for many entrants.","My race traditionally takes place on Patriots' Day.","I am a major annual road race in Massachusetts.","My finish line is on Boylston Street."],[]],["Iditarod","Sporting Events",["Weather can change the challenge from one day to the next.","The competitors rely on a close partnership with animals.","My route covers great distances through remote snow.","I am a long-distance sled-dog race in Alaska.","My name is associated with a route from Anchorage toward Nome."],[]],["Isle of Man TT","Sporting Events",["My course is unlike a modern enclosed circuit.","Public roads become a high-speed competitive route.","My event is famous for its risks and long history.","I am a motorcycle road race on an island in the Irish Sea.","My Mountain Course winds through towns and countryside."],[]],["America's Cup","Sporting Events",["Technology and tactics strongly influence my results.","My participants compete in vessels powered by wind.","Teams represent clubs rather than national squads.","I am a famous international yacht-racing trophy.","I date to an 1851 race around the Isle of Wight."],[]],["UEFA Champions League","Sporting Events",["Clubs qualify through their domestic competitions.","My matches bring together teams from multiple European nations.","A knockout phase eventually determines the winner.","I am Europe's leading annual men's club football competition.","My anthem is widely recognized before major matches."],[]],["Paralympic Games","Sporting Events",["Adaptation and elite performance define my mission.","My competitions take place in many disciplines.","Athletes compete in classifications based on eligible impairments.","I am a major international multisport event for athletes with disabilities.","I generally follow the Olympic Games in the same host city."],[]],["Winter Olympic Games","Sporting Events",["Weather and specialized surfaces shape my program.","My host communities are often in mountainous or cold regions.","My competitions include both sliding and ice-based disciplines.","I am a major international multisport event held every four years.","Skiing, figure skating and ice hockey are among my sports."],[]],["Fencing foil","Sports & Games",["My scoring rules reward precision.","I am lighter than some related competitive weapons.","Only a restricted target area counts for valid hits.","Only touches to the torso count in my usual scoring rules.","My tip and electronic scoring system help determine touches."],[]],["Synchronized swimming","Sports & Games",["Breath control is essential during my routines.","Music and coordinated movements shape my performances.","Athletes perform choreographed figures in water.","I am a pool-based sport now officially called artistic swimming.","Teams and duets perform routines both above and below the surface."],[]],["Artistic gymnastics","Sports & Games",["Balance, strength and precision are central to me.","Athletes perform routines on several different apparatus.","Scoring considers difficulty and execution.","I am a gymnastics discipline featuring apparatus such as bars and beam.","My events include floor exercise and vault."],[]],["Rhythmic gymnastics","Sports & Games",["I combine music and carefully timed motion.","A hand-held object often becomes part of a routine.","Grace and complex body movement are important in scoring.","I am a gymnastics discipline involving ribbon, hoop, ball and clubs.","My Olympic competitions feature individual and group routines."],[]],["Trampolining","Sports & Games",["My athletes gain height from an elastic surface.","Twists and somersaults form part of the routines.","Control of landing and body position is critical.","I am a gymnastics discipline performed on a springy jumping bed.","Competitors perform sequences of aerial acrobatic skills."],[]],["Steeplechase","Sports & Games",["My route contains obstacles absent from ordinary distance races.","Runners must preserve rhythm while clearing barriers.","One obstacle includes a landing area of water.","I am a track race commonly held over three thousand meters.","I combine distance running with hurdles and a water jump."],[]],["Decathlon","Sports & Games",["My winner must excel in many different kinds of performance.","Events take place across two days.","A points system combines results rather than adding finishing positions.","I am a ten-event track-and-field competition.","My program includes sprints, jumps, throws and a final 1500-meter run."],[]],["Race walking","Sports & Games",["My rules restrict how an athlete moves rather than where.","Officials can judge technique as well as speed.","Continuous contact with the ground is essential.","I am a competitive athletics event with a straightened leading leg rule.","I am often held over road distances such as 20 kilometers."],[]],["Marathon swimming","Sports & Games",["My environment introduces factors absent from a pool.","Navigation and pacing matter over long distances.","Athletes compete in open water for extended periods.","I am a long-distance swimming discipline.","My Olympic race traditionally covers ten kilometers."],[]],["Louvre Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My home once served as a royal residence.","My immense collection spans centuries and cultures.","A glass pyramid marks a modern entrance.","Visitors enter my former royal complex beneath a celebrated glass pyramid.","The Mona Lisa and Venus de Milo are among my treasures."],[]],["British Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My collection prompts debates about cultural ownership.","My exhibits span many continents and ancient societies.","An enormous covered court occupies my center.","A famous inscribed stone helped scholars decipher ancient Egyptian writing here.","The Rosetta Stone is one of my most famous objects."],[]],["Metropolitan Museum of Art","Museums & Galleries",["My rooms include art from many eras and continents.","Visitors can explore entire reconstructed architectural interiors.","I stand along the edge of a major urban park.","The galleries of my Fifth Avenue building open onto a famous urban park.","My grand steps face Fifth Avenue beside Central Park."],[]],["Museum of Modern Art","Museums & Galleries",["My collection helped define how audiences encounter recent artistic movements.","Painting, film, design and architecture share space here.","My galleries are in Midtown Manhattan.","I am a major New York institution devoted to modern art.","Works including The Starry Night are displayed here."],[]],["Prado Museum","Museums & Galleries",["Royal collecting shaped my early holdings.","European painting is a particular strength of mine.","Spanish masters dominate some of my most visited rooms.","A court painting depicting an artist at work is one of my best-known works.","Velázquez's Las Meninas is one of my highlights."],[]],["Reina Sofía Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My building once served a very different public purpose.","My collection focuses mainly on more recent creative movements.","I stand within a famous triangle of museums.","One monumental painting here responds to an aerial attack during the Spanish Civil War.","Picasso's Guernica is the centerpiece of my collection."],[]],["Rijksmuseum","Museums & Galleries",["My national collection covers both fine art and historical objects.","A distinctive red-brick building houses my galleries.","Dutch Golden Age painting is one of my special strengths.","A monumental painting of a civic militia is among my Dutch Golden Age highlights.","Rembrandt's The Night Watch is displayed here."],[]],["Van Gogh Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My collection follows one artist's changing style.","Personal letters deepen the story told by my exhibits.","My institution is located in the Netherlands.","I am an Amsterdam museum devoted to a famous post-Impressionist.","Sunflowers and numerous self-portraits are associated with my namesake."],[]],["Uffizi Gallery","Museums & Galleries",["My origins are linked to a powerful ruling family.","My architecture once housed government offices.","Renaissance masterpieces fill my corridors.","My building was commissioned by the Medici and once held administrative offices.","Botticelli's The Birth of Venus is exhibited here."],[]],["Vatican Museums","Museums & Galleries",["My collections grew through centuries of religious patronage.","Long corridors link galleries full of art and antiquities.","One of my most celebrated spaces has an elaborately painted ceiling.","I am a series of museums within Vatican City.","Michelangelo's Sistine Chapel ceiling is a major attraction here."],[]],["National Gallery London","Museums & Galleries",["My collection emphasizes European painting rather than sculpture.","My central location attracts large numbers of free visitors.","A broad classical façade overlooks a busy public square.","My neoclassical façade looks across a square named for a naval battle.","My paintings include works by Turner, Van Eyck and Leonardo da Vinci."],[]],["Tate Modern","Museums & Galleries",["My building once produced energy rather than exhibiting art.","A tall industrial chimney remains part of my skyline.","A vast former turbine hall hosts monumental installations.","I am a major modern-art museum on London's South Bank.","I occupy a converted power station beside the Thames."],[]],["Guggenheim Museum Bilbao","Museums & Galleries",["My exterior is as discussed as the art within.","Curving surfaces create an unconventional shape.","My location became a symbol of urban cultural renewal.","I am an art museum in the Basque Country of Spain.","Frank Gehry designed my titanium-clad building."],[]],["Acropolis Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My displays are arranged with an archaeological landscape in mind.","Transparent floors reveal remains beneath my building.","Ancient marble sculptures dominate several spaces.","My upper gallery aligns with the ancient temple whose sculptures it helps interpret.","My top gallery is oriented toward the Parthenon."],[]],["Egyptian Museum Cairo","Museums & Galleries",["My displays document an extremely long history.","Royal tomb objects have drawn visitors for generations.","My older building stands beside a major urban square.","I am a historic antiquities museum in central Cairo.","For many decades I housed famous artifacts from Tutankhamun's tomb."],[]],["Grand Egyptian Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My design places enormous objects within spacious modern halls.","My collections focus on a single ancient civilization.","I stand outside a large modern city near a famous plateau.","I am an archaeology museum near Giza, Egypt.","My complex displays monumental pharaonic artifacts near the pyramids."],[]],["National Air and Space Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My objects tell stories of exploration beyond ordinary travel.","Early engineering achievements share space with flight technology.","My exhibits are part of a large public museum institution.","A pioneering powered aircraft and early spacecraft anchor my collection.","The Wright Flyer and spacecraft are highlights of my collections."],[]],["Smithsonian National Museum of Natural History","Museums & Galleries",["My specimens cover creatures, minerals and human cultures.","A large central rotunda greets many visitors.","My collections support scientific research as well as exhibitions.","I am a Smithsonian institution on the National Mall.","A famous blue gemstone called the Hope Diamond is displayed here."],[]],["National Museum of African American History and Culture","Museums & Galleries",["My building's outer pattern carries historical symbolism.","My exhibits connect personal lives with broad national events.","I trace experiences from slavery through civil rights and contemporary culture.","My bronze-colored tiered façade draws on African architectural forms.","My tiered bronze-colored exterior stands on the National Mall."],[]],["National Museum of the American Indian","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibitions emphasize living cultures, not only the past.","Curved stone architecture reflects an organic design.","Indigenous communities have influenced how my collections are interpreted.","I am a Smithsonian museum on the National Mall.","My exhibits focus on Native peoples of the Americas."],[]],["American Museum of Natural History","Museums & Galleries",["My collection includes specimens from far before human history.","Large dioramas recreate environments around the world.","Astronomy and planetary science also have a home in my complex.","A suspended whale model hangs among my natural-history dioramas.","A giant blue whale model hangs in one of my halls."],[]],["Field Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My origins are connected to a major nineteenth-century exposition.","I study both natural history and human cultures.","Fossils are among my best-known exhibits.","One of the world's most studied Tyrannosaurus skeletons is displayed in my halls.","The famous Tyrannosaurus rex specimen SUE is displayed here."],[]],["Art Institute of Chicago","Museums & Galleries",["My collections span ancient works and modern movements.","A pair of animal sculptures guards my entrance.","My institution sits near a famous city park.","A pair of bronze lions guards the entrance to my historic building.","American Gothic and A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte are in my collection."],[]],["Getty Center","Museums & Galleries",["Visitors often arrive by a small hillside tram.","Pale stone buildings surround landscaped gardens.","My views extend across a vast American city.","I am an art complex in the hills above Los Angeles.","Architect Richard Meier designed my main campus."],[]],["The Broad","Museums & Galleries",["My architecture uses a distinctive outer veil.","My collection emphasizes recent and contemporary art.","A celebrated immersive installation requires special viewing arrangements.","I am a contemporary-art museum in downtown Los Angeles.","Yayoi Kusama's Infinity Mirror Rooms are associated with my galleries."],[]],["Los Angeles County Museum of Art","Museums & Galleries",["My campus has hosted notable outdoor public art.","My collection draws from many cultures and periods.","A large field of restored streetlights draws nighttime visitors.","Rows of restored street lamps form an outdoor artwork on my campus.","Urban Light by Chris Burden stands outside my complex."],[]],["California Academy of Sciences","Museums & Galleries",["My work combines science education with active research.","My building incorporates a living roof.","Several different natural environments appear under one roof.","A living roof crowns a complex containing an aquarium and rainforest dome.","My complex includes an aquarium, planetarium and rainforest dome."],[]],["Exploratorium","Museums & Galleries",["Visitors learn by manipulating real objects.","My philosophy encourages asking questions through experiments.","Many exhibits demonstrate sound, light and perception.","I am a hands-on science museum on San Francisco's waterfront.","My interactive exhibits occupy Pier 15."],[]],["Intrepid Sea Air and Space Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibition space was once itself a working vehicle.","I am moored beside a crowded metropolitan island.","Aircraft and space artifacts share space aboard my exhibits.","My exhibits occupy a retired aircraft carrier moored alongside Manhattan.","My central attraction is a retired aircraft carrier."],[]],["Anne Frank House","Museums & Galleries",["My central exhibit is an ordinary space with extraordinary history.","Visitors move through rooms once hidden behind a concealed entrance.","A wartime diary made my story internationally known.","The hidden rooms behind a movable bookcase are preserved for visitors.","I preserve the secret annex where a Jewish teenager hid during World War II."],[]],["Mauritshuis","Museums & Galleries",["My intimate size contrasts with larger national institutions.","My galleries display masterpieces from a celebrated Dutch era.","A seventeenth-century palace houses my collection.","A celebrated painted portrait of a girl with a pearl earring hangs here.","Vermeer's Girl with a Pearl Earring is among my famous paintings."],[]],["Stedelijk Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My program emphasizes innovation in art and design.","I stand near other prominent cultural institutions.","A contemporary white extension transformed my exterior.","I am an Amsterdam museum of modern and contemporary art.","My unusual annex is sometimes nicknamed the bathtub."],[]],["Pergamon Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibits were arranged around monumental architectural reconstructions.","Ancient cities across the Near East shaped my holdings.","My institution occupies part of a famous island of museums.","A reconstructed blue gateway from ancient Babylon is associated with my collection.","The Ishtar Gate is one of my best-known displays."],[]],["Neues Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My historic building was carefully restored after wartime damage.","Ancient cultures are the main focus of my galleries.","I am part of a group of museums on an island in Europe.","My galleries feature a distinctive ancient Egyptian royal bust.","A famous bust of the Egyptian queen Nefertiti is displayed here."],[]],["Jewish Museum Berlin","Museums & Galleries",["My architecture is intended to provoke reflection.","Voids and sharp angles carry symbolic meaning.","My exhibits explore centuries of Jewish life in one country.","My zigzag extension contains stark voids intended to evoke historical absence.","Daniel Libeskind designed my distinctive zigzag extension."],[]],["Mercedes-Benz Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My building traces an industry through a spiral-like journey.","Historic vehicles illustrate changing transportation technology.","My collection tells the story of a long-established manufacturer.","A spiral exhibition path traces the changing technology of motor vehicles.","The three-pointed star emblem features prominently in my exhibits."],[]],["BMW Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My collections span motorcycles as well as automobiles.","My building stands near a company's headquarters.","Design and racing heritage are recurring themes.","A circular building near a four-cylinder-shaped headquarters displays vehicles.","I stand beside the landmark four-cylinder-shaped office tower."],[]],["Museo Soumaya","Museums & Galleries",["My exterior has a reflective, sculptural surface.","The collection includes European and Mexican art.","My institution was founded by a prominent business family.","My curved exterior is covered by thousands of reflective hexagonal tiles.","My curved façade is covered with hexagonal aluminum tiles."],[]],["National Museum of Anthropology Mexico","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibits focus on people and civilizations of a large region.","My central courtyard has a dramatic architectural canopy.","Ancient stone carvings form a major part of the collection.","A giant stone disk depicting a Mesoamerican calendar is among my treasures.","The Aztec Sun Stone is a famous object in my galleries."],[]],["Museu do Amanhã","Museums & Galleries",["My themes look forward rather than only backward.","Science and sustainability are central to my exhibitions.","My building has a long sculptural roof on a harbor.","My futuristic waterfront building explores the choices shaping humanity's future.","Santiago Calatrava designed my Museum of Tomorrow building."],[]],["Pinacoteca de São Paulo","Museums & Galleries",["My galleries are housed in a historic brick building.","My collection gives special attention to art from my nation.","Light fills an elegant interior with bridges and courtyards.","Exposed brick and airy courtyards frame a major collection of Brazilian art.","My collection includes major Brazilian paintings and sculpture."],[]],["Tokyo National Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My collections span an extensive cultural tradition.","Several buildings hold different forms of art and archaeology.","My institution stands near a large city park.","Japanese art and archaeological objects fill galleries beside Ueno Park.","My galleries are in Ueno Park and feature Japanese and Asian antiquities."],[]],["National Museum of Korea","Museums & Galleries",["My objects range from prehistoric tools to fine ceramics.","A broad modern building holds an important national collection.","My exhibits preserve Buddhist and royal artistic traditions.","My collection includes delicate celadon ceramics and Buddhist artworks.","My permanent galleries include Korean calligraphy and celadon pottery."],[]],["National Palace Museum Taipei","Museums & Galleries",["My objects were collected over many imperial generations.","Fine ceramics and carved objects are major highlights.","My holdings include treasures carried across a strait in the twentieth century.","One famous object in my imperial collection resembles a cabbage carved from jade.","A small jade carving of a cabbage is among my most famous pieces."],[]],["Shanghai Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My collections emphasize traditional artistic techniques.","Bronze vessels and ceramics are major strengths.","My institution contains important works of calligraphy.","Ancient bronzes, ceramics and calligraphy are specialties of my collection.","Ancient Chinese bronzes are among my best-known collections."],[]],["National Museum of Singapore","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibits trace the transformation of a trading settlement.","My institution occupies a historic building with a domed rotunda.","Multimedia presentations connect artifacts to national memory.","A domed rotunda connects a historic building with multimedia exhibits on national life.","My galleries explore the island state's history and culture."],[]],["ArtScience Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My architecture resembles an open hand or flower.","My exhibits cross boundaries between technology and creativity.","I stand beside a waterfront complex.","My lotus-like structure overlooks a waterfront entertainment complex.","My lotus-shaped building is part of the Marina Bay Sands precinct."],[]],["Museum of Islamic Art Doha","Museums & Galleries",["My building stands on reclaimed land beside the water.","Geometric forms reflect the traditions represented in my exhibits.","Objects from across centuries and regions form my collection.","Architect I. M. Pei designed my geometric building beside the water.","Architect I. M. Pei designed my striking waterfront building."],[]],["Louvre Abu Dhabi","Museums & Galleries",["Light passes through layers of a complex roof.","My collection connects art across periods and civilizations.","Water surrounds parts of my gallery complex.","I am a major art museum in the United Arab Emirates.","Jean Nouvel designed my enormous perforated dome."],[]],["Te Papa Tongarewa","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibitions combine natural history with cultural heritage.","Indigenous knowledge influences how stories are presented.","I am a major national institution on a waterfront.","Māori cultural treasures are displayed alongside natural-history collections.","My collections feature Māori taonga and Pacific culture."],[]],["Australian Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My roots reach back to early colonial scientific collecting.","My exhibits cover the natural world and human history.","Fossils and Australian wildlife are prominent topics.","My collections emphasize wildlife and Indigenous cultures of a vast island continent.","My galleries include Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander cultural collections."],[]],["Melbourne Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibits explore both the environment and the past.","A living forest is recreated within my complex.","My galleries include science, design and Indigenous culture.","I am a major museum in the Australian state of Victoria.","I stand beside the Royal Exhibition Building in Carlton Gardens."],[]],["Museum of the Future Dubai","Museums & Galleries",["My building has an unusual opening through its center.","The exterior uses flowing calligraphy as part of the design.","My exhibitions imagine changing technologies and societies.","I am a futuristic museum in the United Arab Emirates.","My torus-shaped building stands along Sheikh Zayed Road."],[]],["Apartheid Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibitions confront a system of institutional injustice.","Personal stories and historical documents shape the visitor experience.","My galleries examine the long struggle for political equality.","My exhibits trace racial segregation and the struggle to establish democracy.","My exhibits trace apartheid and the transition to democracy."],[]],["Zeitz MOCAA","Museums & Galleries",["My architecture transforms a former industrial structure.","I focus on creative work from a broad continental region.","My exhibition spaces occupy tall concrete tubes and galleries.","I am a contemporary-art museum at Cape Town's V&A Waterfront.","A former grain silo houses my collection of African art."],[]],["District Six Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My exhibits preserve the memory of a displaced community.","Maps and personal accounts are central to my displays.","My story concerns forced removals under an unjust system.","A large map and family accounts recall a community uprooted by forced removals.","I document a neighborhood demolished during South African apartheid."],[]],["Robben Island Museum","Museums & Galleries",["My location gave authorities physical separation from the mainland.","Guided visits reveal cells and former prison buildings.","My story is closely tied to a nation's long struggle for freedom.","I am a historic island museum near Cape Town.","Nelson Mandela was imprisoned here for many years."],[]],["Michael Faraday","Scientists & Inventors",["I rose in science without a conventional university education.","My experiments revealed connections between different physical forces.","I helped explain how moving fields can generate electrical effects.","I discovered electromagnetic induction in the nineteenth century.","My name is associated with a famous cage that blocks electric fields."],[]],["James Clerk Maxwell","Scientists & Inventors",["My mathematical work united several separate observations.","I developed a statistical account of molecular motion as well as field theory.","My equations described the behavior of electricity and magnetism.","I predicted electromagnetic waves travelling at the speed of light.","The four famous field equations associated with me bear my surname."],[]],["Niels Bohr","Scientists & Inventors",["My career bridged classical ideas and new physical theories.","I studied the structure of matter at tiny scales.","My model used discrete levels rather than continuous paths.","I proposed a quantum model of the hydrogen atom.","An institute in Copenhagen and a model of atomic structure bear my name."],[]],["Max Planck","Scientists & Inventors",["My most famous insight began as a problem about heat and light.","I proposed a constant that became central to physical theory.","My work suggested energy exchange occurs in discrete amounts.","I helped launch quantum theory by studying blackbody radiation.","A fundamental quantum constant bears my surname."],[]],["Erwin Schrödinger","Scientists & Inventors",["My research challenged familiar descriptions of physical systems.","I explored how matter behaves like waves.","My equation describes the evolution of quantum states.","I developed a central equation of wave mechanics.","A thought experiment involving a cat is named after me."],[]],["Werner Heisenberg","Scientists & Inventors",["My theory changed what scientists could predict about tiny systems.","I developed a mathematical approach to quantum behavior.","My best-known principle limits simultaneous knowledge of certain properties.","I formulated a fundamental relation concerning position and momentum.","The uncertainty principle is named after me."],[]],["Paul Dirac","Scientists & Inventors",["I preferred elegant equations to elaborate explanation.","My mathematics joined two major ideas in physics.","My work predicted a particle before it was detected.","I developed a relativistic theory of the electron.","The Dirac equation led to the prediction of antimatter."],[]],["Richard Feynman","Scientists & Inventors",["My teaching made difficult ideas accessible through vivid examples.","I helped develop a powerful calculation method for particle interactions.","My diagrams simplified the description of quantum processes.","I received a Nobel Prize for work on quantum electrodynamics.","My namesake diagrams illustrate how particles interact."],[]],["Stephen Hawking","Scientists & Inventors",["My research explored extreme regions of spacetime.","I communicated complex cosmology to a broad audience.","My work connected gravity with quantum phenomena.","I showed that black holes should emit thermal radiation.","I wrote A Brief History of Time."],[]],["Carl Sagan","Scientists & Inventors",["My communication drew many people toward scientific curiosity.","I studied planetary atmospheres and the possibility of life elsewhere.","A famous television series carried my ideas to the public.","I was an astronomer who popularized science through Cosmos.","I called Earth a pale blue dot."],[]],["Edwin Hubble","Scientists & Inventors",["My observations changed estimates of the universe's scale.","I studied fuzzy objects once thought to lie within our galaxy.","Measurements showed many galaxies receding at different speeds.","My work helped establish the expansion of the universe.","A major orbiting space telescope bears my name."],[]],["Vera Rubin","Scientists & Inventors",["My measurements exposed a puzzle about visible matter.","I studied the motion of stars and gas in galaxies.","Outer regions rotated faster than expected from their luminous contents.","My galaxy-rotation work provided strong evidence for dark matter.","I was an American astronomer whose work transformed cosmology."],[]],["Henrietta Leavitt","Scientists & Inventors",["My work transformed observations into a measuring tool.","I studied variable stars recorded on astronomical photographs.","I found a link between a repeating interval and intrinsic brightness.","My discovery made a class of stars useful as distance indicators.","The Cepheid period-luminosity relation is associated with me."],[]],["Annie Jump Cannon","Scientists & Inventors",["My systematic attention to detail organized an enormous collection.","I compared light patterns across thousands of astronomical objects.","My scheme simplified an older classification system.","I helped develop the sequence of stellar spectral types.","The familiar O-B-A-F-G-K-M star classification is linked to me."],[]],["Cecilia Payne-Gaposchkin","Scientists & Inventors",["My conclusion challenged established assumptions about the heavens.","I studied the meaning of patterns in stars' spectra.","My research revealed their chemical composition.","I showed that stars consist mainly of hydrogen and helium.","My 1925 doctoral thesis is celebrated in astrophysics."],[]],["Jocelyn Bell Burnell","Scientists & Inventors",["A strange repeating signal first looked like interference.","I noticed an unusual pattern while analyzing radio observations.","My discovery revealed rapidly rotating stellar remnants.","I helped discover the first radio pulsars in 1967.","I was a graduate student when the first pulsar signal was identified."],[]],["Lise Meitner","Scientists & Inventors",["My insight helped explain a startling experimental result.","I worked closely with researchers studying heavy atomic nuclei.","I recognized how a nucleus could split and release substantial energy.","I helped provide the physical interpretation of nuclear fission.","A chemical element was later named in my honor."],[]],["Emmy Noether","Scientists & Inventors",["My work connected two areas many had treated separately.","I became influential despite barriers in academic mathematics.","I showed how symmetry leads to conserved quantities.","My theorem links continuous symmetries and conservation laws.","My surname names a foundational theorem in mathematical physics."],[]],["Srinivasa Ramanujan","Scientists & Inventors",["My mathematical discoveries grew from unusual beginnings.","I developed striking identities with little formal training.","My work involved partitions, infinite series and number theory.","I collaborated with G. H. Hardy at Cambridge.","A famous anecdote connects me with the number 1729."],[]],["Leonhard Euler","Scientists & Inventors",["My productivity extended across many mathematical fields.","I introduced notation that became standard for generations.","My work connected geometry, analysis and number theory.","I helped popularize the symbols e and f(x).","A celebrated identity links e, i and pi with my name."],[]],["Carl Friedrich Gauss","Scientists & Inventors",["I made important discoveries while still very young.","My research ranged from geometry to astronomy.","I gave powerful methods for handling numerical data.","My name appears in the familiar bell-shaped normal distribution.","I am sometimes called the prince of mathematicians."],[]],["Bernhard Riemann","Scientists & Inventors",["My work expanded how mathematicians describe space.","I studied abstract properties of curved geometries.","My ideas later helped provide tools for general relativity.","I proposed a famous conjecture about zeros of a function.","The Riemann hypothesis concerns the distribution of prime numbers."],[]],["Euclid","Scientists & Inventors",["My work shaped education for more than two millennia.","I built an organized system from definitions and propositions.","My logical method became a model for mathematical argument.","I wrote a foundational ancient treatise on geometry.","My famous book is called the Elements."],[]],["Archimedes","Scientists & Inventors",["My work combined practical machines with mathematical reasoning.","I explored volumes, areas and mechanical equilibrium.","A famous discovery came from considering objects submerged in liquids.","I described the principle of buoyancy.","An ancient story has me shouting Eureka after a bath."],[]],["Pythagoras","Scientists & Inventors",["My followers connected mathematics with philosophy and harmony.","I am associated with relationships among whole numbers.","A familiar geometric relation involves the sides of one triangle.","A famous theorem links the squares of a right triangle's sides.","That right-triangle theorem bears my name."],[]],["Sophie Germain","Scientists & Inventors",["I pursued mathematics despite restrictions on women's education.","I studied vibration and the behavior of elastic surfaces.","My number-theory work contributed to a famous unsolved problem.","I made progress toward Fermat's Last Theorem.","A class of prime numbers bears my name."],[]],["Maryam Mirzakhani","Scientists & Inventors",["My research explored shapes beyond ordinary Euclidean geometry.","I studied dynamic systems on curved surfaces.","I achieved a landmark distinction in a prestigious mathematical prize.","I was the first woman to receive a Fields Medal.","My work focused on moduli spaces and hyperbolic geometry."],[]],["Terence Tao","Scientists & Inventors",["My interests span several mathematical disciplines.","My early talent led to unusually rapid academic progress.","I work in analysis, number theory and related fields.","I received the Fields Medal in 2006.","I am an Australian-born mathematician known for influential work at UCLA."],[]],["George Boole","Scientists & Inventors",["My abstract ideas became practical long after my lifetime.","I explored operations that use a small set of logical values.","My algebra allowed logical statements to be manipulated mathematically.","My work underpins digital switching and computer logic.","The familiar true-false algebra bears my surname."],[]],["Margaret Hamilton","Scientists & Inventors",["My work prioritized reliability under extreme constraints.","I helped build systems where failures could have serious consequences.","My team developed software that supported human travel beyond Earth.","I led software engineering for NASA's Apollo guidance computer.","A famous photograph shows me standing beside stacks of Apollo code."],[]],["Radia Perlman","Scientists & Inventors",["My innovations made large networks more reliable.","My work addressed loops that can disrupt communication.","I developed a method that helps switches form a stable topology.","I invented the spanning tree protocol for network bridges.","I am sometimes called the mother of the internet."],[]],["Hedy Lamarr","Scientists & Inventors",["My public career overshadowed an inventive side.","I helped imagine a technique for changing signals during transmission.","My idea was intended to make radio control harder to jam.","I co-patented a frequency-hopping communications method.","I was also a Hollywood film star."],[]],["Claude Shannon","Scientists & Inventors",["My theories connected communication with probability.","I asked how much information a message contains.","My equations described limits of reliable data transmission.","I helped found information theory in 1948.","A fundamental unit of information and a famous entropy formula feature in my work."],[]],["John von Neumann","Scientists & Inventors",["I contributed to mathematics, physics and computing.","My ideas influenced the organization of programmable machines.","I helped formalize a model of computer memory and instructions.","My name is linked to a common stored-program computer architecture.","I also made foundational contributions to game theory."],[]],["Donald Knuth","Scientists & Inventors",["My work values both correctness and careful presentation.","I studied how to analyze computational procedures.","A multivolume project became a landmark for programmers.","I wrote The Art of Computer Programming.","I also created the TeX typesetting system."],[]],["Barbara Liskov","Scientists & Inventors",["My ideas helped programmers reason about complex software.","I studied abstraction and reliable distributed systems.","A principle associated with me concerns replacing one type with another.","I received the Turing Award for contributions to programming languages.","The Liskov substitution principle bears my name."],[]],["Vint Cerf","Scientists & Inventors",["My work helped previously separate systems communicate.","I contributed to early packet-based networking.","A shared set of protocols enabled networks to interconnect.","I co-designed TCP/IP with Bob Kahn.","I am sometimes called one of the fathers of the internet."],[]],["Linus Torvalds","Scientists & Inventors",["My project grew far beyond its original personal scope.","I encourage open collaboration around software development.","I created a widely used operating-system kernel.","I also developed the Git version-control system.","My first name is associated with the Linux kernel."],[]],["Guido van Rossum","Scientists & Inventors",["I favored readability as a design principle.","My creation uses indentation as a core syntactic feature.","My programming language became common in research and automation.","I created the Python programming language.","I was long known as its benevolent dictator for life."],[]],["Ken Thompson","Scientists & Inventors",["My work helped define modern operating-system design.","I collaborated on software that shaped generations of programmers.","I developed a small elegant system while working at Bell Labs.","I helped create Unix.","I also contributed to the early development of the Go programming language."],[]],["Dennis Ritchie","Scientists & Inventors",["My work linked practical systems programming with language design.","My inventions influenced countless later software tools.","I created a language that remains important in low-level computing.","I developed the C programming language.","I co-created Unix alongside Ken Thompson."],[]],["John McCarthy","Scientists & Inventors",["My research explored whether machines could reason.","I helped establish a field by giving it a lasting name.","My work included a language designed around symbolic computation.","I created the Lisp programming language.","I coined the term artificial intelligence."],[]],["Marvin Minsky","Scientists & Inventors",["I studied how simple processes might produce complex intelligence.","My work helped establish a major research laboratory.","I contributed to early machine perception and symbolic reasoning.","I co-founded MIT's Artificial Intelligence Laboratory.","I wrote The Society of Mind."],[]],["Geoffrey Hinton","Scientists & Inventors",["My research revived interest in methods once considered impractical.","I studied layered models that learn representations from data.","My work helped advance neural networks trained through gradients.","I contributed to the development and popularization of deep learning.","I shared the 2018 Turing Award for work on neural networks."],[]],["Yoshua Bengio","Scientists & Inventors",["My research concerns machines learning useful representations.","I studied how neural systems can generalize from examples.","My work helped advance language models and deep architectures.","I was among the researchers honored with the 2018 Turing Award.","I am a prominent deep-learning scientist based in Montreal."],[]],["Yann LeCun","Scientists & Inventors",["My early research explored how visual patterns can be recognized.","I developed learning systems that process spatial information.","My methods became important in computer vision.","I helped pioneer convolutional neural networks.","I was one of the three researchers recognized with the 2018 Turing Award."],[]],["Fei-Fei Li","Scientists & Inventors",["My work asks how machines perceive and understand images.","I helped coordinate an ambitious effort to organize visual examples.","My research influenced modern computer-vision benchmarks.","I led the creation of the ImageNet dataset.","I am a Stanford computer scientist prominent in human-centered AI."],[]],["Demis Hassabis","Scientists & Inventors",["My early interests included strategy and complex games.","I helped build systems capable of learning difficult tasks.","My organization later worked on predicting biological structures.","I co-founded DeepMind.","I shared the 2024 Nobel Prize in Chemistry for protein-structure prediction."],[]],["Jennifer Doudna","Scientists & Inventors",["My research began with an interest in how molecules control genes.","I helped adapt a natural mechanism for precise editing.","A programmable guide molecule directs a molecular cutting tool.","I co-developed CRISPR-based gene editing.","I shared the 2020 Nobel Prize in Chemistry with Emmanuelle Charpentier."],[]],["Emmanuelle Charpentier","Scientists & Inventors",["Microbial defense systems were central to my discoveries.","I collaborated across disciplines to develop a powerful new tool.","My research showed how an RNA-guided enzyme could target DNA.","I co-developed CRISPR-based genome editing.","I shared the 2020 Nobel Prize in Chemistry with Jennifer Doudna."],[]],["Katalin Karikó","Scientists & Inventors",["My research sought to make a fragile biological molecule useful.","I spent years working on a method with limited early support.","Modifying a molecule reduced unwanted immune reactions.","My work enabled effective messenger-RNA vaccines.","I shared the 2023 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine."],[]],["Drew Weissman","Scientists & Inventors",["My discoveries involved the body's response to introduced genetic messages.","I worked with a colleague on a modified form of a biological molecule.","Our findings improved the prospects of a new vaccine platform.","I contributed to the development of mRNA vaccine technology.","I shared the 2023 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine with Katalin Karikó."],[]],["Tu Youyou","Scientists & Inventors",["Traditional knowledge helped guide my research.","I searched for new ways to treat a major infectious disease.","My work identified a powerful compound from a plant.","I discovered artemisinin as an antimalarial treatment.","I received the 2015 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine."],[]],["Barbara McClintock","Scientists & Inventors",["My discoveries challenged the idea that genetic material was fixed in place.","I studied patterns in the inheritance of plant traits.","Unusual changes in color helped reveal a molecular mechanism.","I discovered mobile genetic elements in maize.","I received the 1983 Nobel Prize for transposable elements."],[]],["Dorothy Hodgkin","Scientists & Inventors",["I studied how small molecules arrange themselves in space.","Diffraction patterns helped me construct atomic models.","I determined structures of medically important compounds.","My X-ray crystallography revealed the structure of vitamin B12.","I received the 1964 Nobel Prize in Chemistry."],[]],["Rita Levi-Montalcini","Scientists & Inventors",["I continued scientific work despite political persecution.","My experiments explored how nerve cells develop.","I helped discover a signal that stimulates neural growth.","I identified nerve growth factor.","I shared the 1986 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine."],[]],["Frances Arnold","Scientists & Inventors",["My work borrowed a strategy from nature to improve technology.","I studied how repeated variation and selection can change biological catalysts.","My methods produced more effective enzymes.","I pioneered directed evolution of enzymes.","I received a share of the 2018 Nobel Prize in Chemistry."],[]],["Francis Crick","Scientists & Inventors",["My research crossed from physics into biology.","I collaborated on a model explaining how hereditary information is stored.","Our proposal depended on a paired molecular structure.","I co-proposed the double-helix structure of DNA.","I worked with James Watson on the 1953 DNA model."],[]],["Oswald Avery","Scientists & Inventors",["My experiments asked what carries inherited traits.","I studied a transformation between bacterial strains.","My results challenged the idea that proteins held hereditary instructions.","I helped show that DNA carries genetic information.","My 1944 research with colleagues transformed molecular biology."],[]],["Frederick Sanger","Scientists & Inventors",["My methods allowed scientists to read complex molecular structures.","I developed techniques for analyzing chains of biological units.","My later work made it possible to sequence genetic material.","I developed a major method of DNA sequencing.","I received two Nobel Prizes in Chemistry."],[]],["Robert Koch","Scientists & Inventors",["My experiments connected specific organisms with specific illnesses.","I developed rigorous methods for studying infectious agents.","I helped establish principles for identifying the causes of diseases.","I identified the bacterium responsible for tuberculosis.","A set of criteria for microbial causation is named after me."],[]],["Edward Jenner","Scientists & Inventors",["My observation of a mild disease helped address a deadly one.","I tested whether one infection could provide protection against another.","My work became an early foundation for immunization.","I developed an early smallpox vaccine using cowpox.","I am often called the father of vaccination."],[]],["Joseph Lister","Scientists & Inventors",["I studied how invisible contaminants affected medical outcomes.","I introduced methods to reduce infections in operations.","Chemical antiseptics changed the way surgical wounds were treated.","I promoted the use of carbolic acid in surgery.","I was a pioneer of antiseptic surgery."],[]],["Ignaz Semmelweis","Scientists & Inventors",["My evidence challenged the routines of my colleagues.","I compared outcomes between different hospital wards.","A simple hygiene measure dramatically reduced illness.","I advocated handwashing to prevent childbed fever.","I was a nineteenth-century physician whose work foreshadowed germ theory."],[]],["Florence Nightingale","Scientists & Inventors",["I used numbers as well as compassion to improve care.","My work drew attention to conditions faced by injured soldiers.","Statistical graphics helped communicate preventable deaths.","I helped reform nursing during and after the Crimean War.","I became known as the Lady with the Lamp."],[]],["Elizabeth Blackwell","Scientists & Inventors",["My path challenged a professional barrier of my era.","I pursued formal training despite repeated rejection.","I worked to broaden opportunities for women in healthcare.","I became the first woman to receive a medical degree in the United States.","I graduated from Geneva Medical College in 1849."],[]],["Virginia Apgar","Scientists & Inventors",["My innovation made a fast judgment possible immediately after a major event.","I sought a consistent way to evaluate newborn health.","My simple scoring framework uses several observable signs.","I developed a five-part assessment of newborn condition.","The Apgar score bears my name."],[]],["Bryce Canyon National Park","National Parks",["My landscape is shaped by freezing, thawing and erosion.","Tall formations rise from a series of natural amphitheaters.","My reddish rocks become dramatic in low sunlight.","I am a protected landscape in southern Utah.","Thousands of hoodoos fill my spectacular amphitheater."],[]],["Glacier National Park","National Parks",["My valleys were carved by enormous sheets of ice.","Wildlife moves through mountains and alpine meadows.","A celebrated scenic road crosses high passes here.","I protect part of Montana's northern Rocky Mountains.","Going-to-the-Sun Road cuts through my dramatic landscape."],[]],["Grand Teton National Park","National Parks",["My mountains rise abruptly above a broad valley.","Lakes and forested foothills lie at the base of rugged summits.","My scenery includes a dramatic cluster of sharp peaks.","I am a protected landscape in northwestern Wyoming.","The Teton Range towers over Jackson Hole here."],[]],["Rocky Mountain National Park","National Parks",["My higher elevations can feel wintry even in summer.","An alpine road crosses terrain above the tree line.","Elk and bighorn sheep are among my notable animals.","I am a national park in north-central Colorado.","Trail Ridge Road offers high views of the Continental Divide."],[]],["Olympic National Park","National Parks",["My ecosystems change dramatically across short distances.","Ancient trees grow in exceptionally wet valleys.","Wild beaches and snow-covered mountains share my boundaries.","I occupy much of a peninsula in Washington State.","The Hoh Rain Forest is one of my celebrated environments."],[]],["Mount Rainier National Park","National Parks",["Flowers blanket some of my slopes in summer.","Permanent ice covers a mountain that dominates the region.","My central summit is an active stratovolcano.","A heavily glaciated active volcano dominates my alpine meadows.","The mountain at my center is one of the most heavily glaciated peaks in the contiguous United States."],[]],["Crater Lake National Park","National Parks",["My greatest feature formed after a violent geological event.","Rain and snow fill a basin without a large flowing outlet.","Deep blue water occupies a collapsed volcanic caldera.","I am a national park in southern Oregon.","Wizard Island rises from my unusually deep lake."],[]],["Redwood National Park","National Parks",["Fog supports enormous organisms in my forests.","Ancient groves extend toward a rugged ocean coast.","My trees are famous for their extraordinary height.","I am a national park on the northern California coast.","I protect some of the tallest living trees on Earth."],[]],["Sequoia National Park","National Parks",["My most famous residents have survived for centuries.","Enormous trunks rise in groves on mountain slopes.","My landscape includes part of the Sierra Nevada.","I am a national park in central California.","General Sherman is among my giant trees."],[]],["Kings Canyon National Park","National Parks",["My rivers have cut deep valleys through granite.","Wild backcountry stretches far from major roads.","High peaks and giant trees occupy different parts of me.","The deep gorge carved by my namesake river lies among giant Sierra Nevada peaks.","My deep canyon is carved by the Kings River."],[]],["Joshua Tree National Park","National Parks",["Two different desert ecosystems meet within me.","Rock formations attract climbers and hikers.","Distinctive branching plants dot many open valleys.","I am a national park in southern California.","My namesake is an unusual desert yucca."],[]],["Great Basin National Park","National Parks",["Some of my living residents are exceptionally old.","My terrain rises sharply from surrounding dry basins.","Limestone caves lie below my alpine slopes.","I am a national park in eastern Nevada.","Bristlecone pines and Lehman Caves are highlights here."],[]],["Capitol Reef National Park","National Parks",["My geology creates a long barrier across the landscape.","Water has carved narrow passages through tilted layers.","Old orchards recall settlers who lived in this dry region.","I am a national park in south-central Utah.","The Waterpocket Fold is my signature geological feature."],[]],["Canyonlands National Park","National Parks",["Rivers have divided my landscape into distinct districts.","High mesas overlook deep canyons and remote trails.","The terrain reveals many layers of colorful rock.","I am a national park in southeastern Utah.","The Colorado and Green Rivers meet within my boundaries."],[]],["Acadia National Park","National Parks",["Tides, granite and forest shape my scenery.","My trails climb rocky summits above an ocean.","A mountain can offer one of the earliest sunrise views in the country.","I am a national park on the coast of Maine.","Cadillac Mountain rises above Mount Desert Island."],[]],["Biscayne National Park","National Parks",["Most of my protected area lies underwater.","Small islands and reefs are important parts of my landscape.","Visitors often explore me by boat rather than by road.","I am a coastal national park in southeastern Florida.","Biscayne Bay and coral reefs form the heart of me."],[]],["Dry Tortugas National Park","National Parks",["Reaching me usually requires a boat or seaplane.","A vast nineteenth-century fort stands on one of my islands.","Clear waters surround a remote chain of keys.","I am a national park west of Key West, Florida.","Fort Jefferson dominates Garden Key here."],[]],["Great Smoky Mountains National Park","National Parks",["Atmospheric haze gives my landscape its name.","Biodiversity thrives in my ancient forested mountains.","Old cabins and settlements preserve Appalachian history.","I straddle the border of Tennessee and North Carolina.","My park includes Clingmans Dome and the Cades Cove valley."],[]],["Shenandoah National Park","National Parks",["A long scenic road follows high ground through my boundaries.","Forested ridges turn vivid colors in autumn.","Numerous overlooks face valleys and rolling countryside.","A long scenic road follows the crest of the Blue Ridge.","Skyline Drive stretches along my mountain crest."],[]],["Congaree National Park","National Parks",["Seasonal flooding helps sustain my trees.","My terrain is low and often damp underfoot.","Boardwalks allow visitors to cross a floodplain forest.","I am a national park in central South Carolina.","I preserve a large tract of old-growth bottomland hardwood forest."],[]],["Mammoth Cave National Park","National Parks",["My most remarkable features cannot be seen from the surface.","Passages have formed through soluble rock over vast periods.","My underground network includes enormous chambers and narrow routes.","My interconnected underground passages extend farther than any known cave system.","My cave system is the longest known in the world."],[]],["Carlsbad Caverns National Park","National Parks",["Ancient marine sediments shaped my underground formations.","Mineral deposits create an intricate subterranean environment.","Bats emerge from cave entrances during warmer months.","I am a national park in southeastern New Mexico.","The Big Room is an enormous limestone cave chamber within me."],[]],["White Sands National Park","National Parks",["My landscape looks snowy but remains warm in summer.","Fine grains shift continually under the wind.","The pale material is unlike the quartz sand of many beaches.","I am a national park in southern New Mexico.","My dunes are formed largely from white gypsum crystals."],[]],["Saguaro National Park","National Parks",["My namesake organisms can grow towering arms over decades.","Dry valleys and nearby mountains define my terrain.","I protect a key part of the Sonoran Desert ecosystem.","I am a national park surrounding Tucson, Arizona.","Giant columnar cacti dominate my landscape."],[]],["Petrified Forest National Park","National Parks",["My rocks record both a former ecosystem and geological time.","Brilliantly colored layers cover broad barren hills.","Fallen trunks were transformed into mineral-rich stone.","I am a national park in northeastern Arizona.","My landscape includes the Painted Desert and fossilized logs."],[]],["Big Bend National Park","National Parks",["A great river forms an international boundary beside me.","My terrain ranges from desert floor to mountain peaks.","Dark skies and remote canyons are major attractions.","I am a national park in southwestern Texas.","The Rio Grande makes a dramatic bend along my edge."],[]],["Guadalupe Mountains National Park","National Parks",["My peaks rise above arid lowlands.","Ancient reefs helped shape the rocks now exposed here.","Hiking routes cross rugged canyons and high ridges.","I am a national park in western Texas.","Guadalupe Peak is the highest point in Texas."],[]],["Wind Cave National Park","National Parks",["My name describes a physical effect at an entrance.","My surface landscape includes prairie wildlife.","Intricate honeycomb formations decorate my underground walls.","Delicate calcite boxwork is among the most unusual formations beneath my grasslands.","I am renowned for rare cave boxwork formations."],[]],["Badlands National Park","National Parks",["Erosion reveals a record of much older environments.","My ground forms steep ridges and narrow gullies.","Open grassland surrounds colorful rock formations.","Fossil-rich rock layers erode into jagged towers above open prairie.","Fossil-rich layered buttes make up my striking terrain."],[]],["Theodore Roosevelt National Park","National Parks",["My landscape influenced a future national leader.","Wild horses and bison live in parts of my terrain.","Rivers have carved rugged hills through plains.","Bison and wild horses roam badlands that influenced a future president.","My name honors a president who promoted conservation."],[]],["Isle Royale National Park","National Parks",["My isolation shapes the relationships between predators and prey.","Visitors travel by boat or aircraft to reach me.","Forests and shorelines surround a long narrow island.","A long-running research project follows wolves and moose on my isolated island.","My wolf and moose populations have been studied for decades."],[]],["Voyageurs National Park","National Parks",["Travel by water is central to exploring me.","My landscape contains many connected lakes and forested islands.","My name recalls historic fur-trade routes.","I am a national park in northern Minnesota.","Houseboats and paddling routes are common ways to experience me."],[]],["North Cascades National Park","National Parks",["My interior contains rugged peaks and heavy snowfall.","Glaciers cling to steep mountain faces.","Wild terrain keeps much of my landscape relatively undeveloped.","I am a national park in northern Washington State.","My range is often nicknamed the American Alps."],[]],["Lassen Volcanic National Park","National Parks",["My landscape displays several forms of volcanic activity.","Steam vents and hot mud reveal heat beneath the surface.","A large peak dominates forests and alpine lakes.","I am a national park in northern California.","My namesake volcano erupted repeatedly in the early twentieth century."],[]],["Channel Islands National Park","National Parks",["Isolation helped my wildlife evolve separately.","Boats carry visitors to rocky coasts and sea caves.","Marine ecosystems surround a group of islands.","I am a national park off the coast of southern California.","Island foxes live on several of my protected islands."],[]],["Pinnacles National Park","National Parks",["My dramatic formations are leftovers from ancient volcanic activity.","Rocky spires create corridors for hikers and climbers.","Large endangered birds can be spotted above the cliffs.","I am a national park in central California.","California condors have been reintroduced around my towering rock pinnacles."],[]],["Haleakalā National Park","National Parks",["Elevation creates dramatic changes in climate and vegetation.","A broad volcanic summit resembles an enormous crater.","Sunrise draws visitors to high exposed terrain.","I am a national park on the Hawaiian island of Maui.","My namesake dormant volcano rises more than ten thousand feet."],[]],["Hawaii Volcanoes National Park","National Parks",["My ground is continually shaped by processes beneath it.","Dark lava fields contrast with lush tropical vegetation.","New rock can be created during eruptions.","I am a national park on the island of Hawaii.","Kīlauea and Mauna Loa are the two famous volcanoes within me."],[]],["Denali National Park","National Parks",["Long winters shape life in my remote wilderness.","Large mammals move across tundra and taiga.","My tallest summit dominates the surrounding mountains.","I am a national park in interior Alaska.","North America's highest mountain lies within me."],[]],["Kenai Fjords National Park","National Parks",["Ice has carved deep channels into my coast.","Wildlife thrives where glaciers meet marine waters.","Large amounts of frozen water remain in my interior.","I am a national park on Alaska's Kenai Peninsula.","The Harding Icefield feeds many of my glaciers."],[]],["Wrangell-St. Elias National Park","National Parks",["My area exceeds that of many smaller countries.","Massive icefields and volcanic mountains dominate my wilderness.","Some of my summits rise among the highest in North America.","I am a national park in southeastern Alaska.","I am the largest national park in the United States."],[]],["Gates of the Arctic National Park","National Parks",["Roads do not connect visitors to my interior.","My landscape is shaped by long polar winters.","Rugged mountain valleys stretch above the Arctic Circle.","I am a remote national park in northern Alaska.","My name refers to a gateway through the Brooks Range."],[]],["Katmai National Park","National Parks",["A dramatic volcanic event reshaped part of my landscape.","Large animals gather when fish migrate upstream.","Visitors sometimes watch predators from platforms beside rivers.","I am a national park in southwestern Alaska.","Brown bears catching salmon at Brooks Falls are a famous sight here."],[]],["Kobuk Valley National Park","National Parks",["My setting combines two landscapes rarely imagined together.","Migration routes pass through my wilderness.","Large dunes rise within a subarctic environment.","I am a remote national park in northwestern Alaska.","The Great Kobuk Sand Dunes are among my most unusual features."],[]],["Lake Clark National Park","National Parks",["Mountains, rivers and lakes form a remote patchwork.","Salmon runs support wildlife in my watersheds.","Volcanoes and glaciers lie within the same protected area.","I am a national park in southwestern Alaska.","Redoubt and Iliamna volcanoes rise in my region."],[]],["Glacier Bay National Park","National Parks",["My landscape changes as enormous ice masses retreat.","Marine mammals move through sheltered waters.","A rugged coastline is lined with mountains and glaciers.","I am a national park in southeastern Alaska.","Tour boats enter my famous glacial fjord system."],[]],["New River Gorge National Park","National Parks",["My terrain makes an ordinary name misleading.","A river carved deep through rugged Appalachian rock.","A spectacular bridge spans the gorge high above the water.","An enormous steel arch spans my river gorge in the Appalachian Mountains.","My iconic steel-arch bridge is associated with an annual celebration."],[]],["Indiana Dunes National Park","National Parks",["My location is close to a major industrial region.","Wind and waves continually reshape my shore.","Beach and wetland ecosystems share a narrow coastal strip.","I am a national park in northwestern Indiana.","My sand dunes line the southern shore of Lake Michigan."],[]],["Gateway Arch National Park","National Parks",["My central landmark was built as a monument to national expansion.","A slender metal structure rises above a riverfront.","Visitors can travel inside a curved structure to an observation area.","Visitors ride inside a stainless-steel curve to a high observation area.","My towering stainless-steel arch marks the Gateway to the West."],[]],["Hot Springs National Park","National Parks",["My protected resource has a long history of public use.","Buildings reflect changing ideas about health and leisure.","Warm water emerges naturally from underground sources.","A historic row of bathhouses surrounds naturally heated springs.","Bathhouse Row is a historic part of my landscape."],[]],["Cuyahoga Valley National Park","National Parks",["My protected lands sit between large urban areas.","Historic transportation routes follow a river valley.","Waterfalls and forested trails attract walkers and cyclists.","I am a national park in northeastern Ohio.","The Ohio and Erie Canal Towpath Trail passes through me."],[]],["Great Sand Dunes National Park","National Parks",["My largest features shift with the wind.","A mountain range rises behind an unusual sandy landscape.","A seasonal creek runs across the dune field's edge.","I am a national park in southern Colorado.","My dunes are the tallest in North America."],[]],["Black Canyon of the Gunnison National Park","National Parks",["My deepest sections receive little direct sunlight.","A river carved a narrow gorge through hard rock.","Sheer dark cliffs rise abruptly above the water.","I am a national park in western Colorado.","Painted Wall is a famous cliff above the Gunnison River."],[]],["Virgin Islands National Park","National Parks",["Marine ecosystems are as important to me as forests.","Historic plantations form part of my cultural landscape.","Clear water and coral reefs surround many sheltered bays.","I am a national park in the U.S. Virgin Islands.","Much of my land lies on the island of St. John."],[]],["National Park of American Samoa","National Parks",["Tropical forest covers steep island mountains.","A coral reef ecosystem meets volcanic coastlines.","My protected areas span parts of several Pacific islands.","I am a U.S. national park in the South Pacific.","My sections lie on Tutuila, Ofu and Ta‘ū islands."],[]],["Los Glaciares National Park","National Parks",["Ice masses stretch between the mountains and lakes.","Trekking routes approach jagged granite peaks.","Huge blue-white walls of ice break into cold water.","One of my glaciers advances into a huge Patagonian lake and breaks off icebergs.","Perito Moreno Glacier is among my best-known attractions."],[]],["Iguazu National Park","National Parks",["Thick forest surrounds an enormous natural spectacle.","Water divides into many channels before dropping steeply.","My protected landscape lies near an international frontier.","I am a national park in northeastern Argentina.","The Devil's Throat is a famous section of my waterfalls."],[]],["Tayrona National Park","National Parks",["Mountain forest descends toward tropical beaches.","Ancient Indigenous cultures have strong ties to my region.","My paths lead to sandy coves and rocky headlands.","I am a national park on Colombia's Caribbean coast.","My beaches lie beneath the Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta."],[]],["Manu National Park","National Parks",["My ecosystems change dramatically with altitude.","Large areas remain difficult for outsiders to enter.","My tropical forests support remarkable biological diversity.","I am a national park in southeastern Peru.","My protected territory stretches from the Andes into the Amazon Basin."],[]],["Kruger National Park","National Parks",["Large mammals roam across broad savanna landscapes.","Seasonal rivers support different concentrations of wildlife.","Visitors often travel by vehicle to watch predators and herbivores.","I am a national park in northeastern South Africa.","Lions, elephants, rhinos, buffalo and leopards are all found here."],[]],["Etosha National Park","National Parks",["A huge pale basin dominates my landscape.","Seasonal waterholes attract wildlife in a dry climate.","Visitors can observe animals gathering beside open water.","I am a national park in northern Namibia.","My enormous salt pan is visible from space."],[]],["Chobe National Park","National Parks",["A major river shapes my wildlife habitats.","Boat-based observation is popular along parts of my boundary.","Large herds of elephants are a hallmark of my ecosystem.","I am a national park in northern Botswana.","The Chobe River supports abundant elephants and hippos."],[]],["Bwindi Impenetrable National Park","National Parks",["My name hints at the difficulty of travel through my terrain.","Moist mountain forests support rare primates.","Hiking routes seek animals living in family groups.","I am a protected forest in southwestern Uganda.","Mountain gorilla trekking is a famous activity here."],[]],["Virunga National Park","National Parks",["My terrain includes both volcanoes and tropical forests.","Conservation work has faced serious regional challenges.","Rare primates live on my misty mountain slopes.","I am a national park in the Democratic Republic of the Congo.","Mountain gorillas inhabit parts of my protected area."],[]],["Amboseli National Park","National Parks",["Open plains make large animals easy to observe.","Seasonal wetlands support wildlife in an otherwise dry landscape.","A towering snow-capped mountain forms a distant backdrop.","Elephants wander across open plains beneath a distant African snowcapped peak.","Elephants are often photographed here with Mount Kilimanjaro behind them."],[]],["Namib-Naukluft National Park","National Parks",["My terrain includes some of the world's oldest desert landscapes.","Wind shapes extraordinarily high dunes.","Dry valleys and salt pans add contrast to the scenery.","I am a vast protected desert region in Namibia.","The famous Sossusvlei dunes lie within my boundaries."],[]],["Fiordland National Park","National Parks",["Glaciers carved deep valleys that later filled with sea water.","Heavy rain feeds waterfalls down steep mountain walls.","Remote forests meet sheltered coastal inlets.","I am a national park on New Zealand's South Island.","Milford Sound and Doubtful Sound are within me."],[]],["Abel Tasman National Park","National Parks",["Walking and boating are common ways to explore me.","Forested headlands enclose sheltered bays.","Coastal tracks link sandy beaches and estuaries.","I am a national park at the top of New Zealand's South Island.","Golden beaches and turquoise water define much of my coastline."],[]],["Tongariro National Park","National Parks",["My landscape reflects the activity of Earth's interior.","Cultural and natural significance are recognized together here.","Hikers traverse volcanic terrain and brightly colored lakes.","I am a national park on New Zealand's North Island.","The Tongariro Alpine Crossing passes by Emerald Lakes."],[]],["Mount Aspiring National Park","National Parks",["My valleys were shaped by deep mountain glaciers.","Remote hiking tracks cross rivers and alpine meadows.","Jagged peaks dominate much of my backcountry.","A jagged summit called Tititea rises above my glacial valleys.","My namesake mountain is also known as Tititea."],[]],["Kakadu National Park","National Parks",["My landscapes shift dramatically with the wet and dry seasons.","Indigenous cultural history spans many thousands of years.","Floodplains, rock shelters and billabongs coexist in my boundaries.","Ancient rock art and seasonally flooded billabongs share my vast landscape.","Aboriginal rock art sites at Ubirr and Nourlangie are major landmarks here."],[]],["Uluru-Kata Tjuta National Park","National Parks",["My landscape has deep cultural meaning for traditional owners.","Giant rock formations rise from dry central plains.","A striking monolith changes apparent color with the light.","Two massive rock formations carry deep meaning for the Anangu traditional owners.","Uluru and the domes of Kata Tjuta are my major features."],[]],["Daintree National Park","National Parks",["My forest contains ancient lineages of plants.","Moist tropical ecosystems extend close to the coast.","Wildlife includes birds and unusual reptiles.","I am a national park in northeastern Queensland, Australia.","My rainforest meets the Great Barrier Reef region near Cape Tribulation."],[]],["Booderee National Park","National Parks",["My coastal ecosystems include heathland and forests.","Indigenous communities are central to my management.","White beaches and clear bays are major attractions.","I am a protected landscape in Jervis Bay Territory, Australia.","My name comes from an Aboriginal language and means bay of plenty."],[]],["Freycinet National Park","National Parks",["Granite peaks rise above a rugged coastline.","Coastal walking tracks reveal striking views of sheltered bays.","The sand and water create contrasting bands of color.","I am a national park on Tasmania's east coast.","Wineglass Bay is my most famous viewpoint."],[]],["Cradle Mountain-Lake St Clair National Park","National Parks",["Alpine wilderness and glacial lakes define my terrain.","Long-distance hikers cross my landscape for days.","A dramatic summit rises above a reflective lake.","A famous long-distance alpine walking trail crosses toward the country's deepest lake.","The Overland Track connects my mountain region to Lake St Clair."],[]],["Galápagos National Park","National Parks",["Isolation made my wildlife important to scientific history.","Many species show adaptations to distinct island environments.","Conservation rules protect both land and surrounding ecosystems.","I am a national park on Ecuador's Pacific islands.","Giant tortoises and marine iguanas are famous inhabitants."],[]],["Komodo National Park","National Parks",["My island landscapes include dry savanna and marine reefs.","Large predatory reptiles attract visitors.","My protected area includes several Indonesian islands.","I am a national park in eastern Indonesia.","The world's largest living lizard inhabits my islands."],[]],["Gunung Leuser National Park","National Parks",["A rich tropical forest covers mountain slopes and valleys.","Rare mammals survive in parts of my ecosystem.","My protected region supports major conservation work.","I am a national park in northern Sumatra, Indonesia.","Wild orangutans live in my rainforests."],[]],["Taman Negara National Park","National Parks",["My forest is considered exceptionally old.","River travel and canopy walks attract visitors.","A humid tropical ecosystem supports diverse plants and animals.","Canopy walkways reveal one of mainland Southeast Asia's oldest rainforests.","My name means national park in Malay."],[]],["Bromo Tengger Semeru National Park","National Parks",["My scenery combines a sandy volcanic plain with high peaks.","Active volcanoes create changing conditions.","Visitors watch sunrise above smoking craters.","Smoky cones emerge from a vast volcanic plain called the Sea of Sand.","Mount Bromo rises from a dramatic Sea of Sand here."],[]],["Kinabalu Park","National Parks",["Plant diversity changes rapidly as elevation increases.","Climbers ascend through several vegetation zones.","A massive granite summit rises above tropical forest.","I am a protected area in Sabah, Malaysian Borneo.","Mount Kinabalu is my central attraction."],[]],["Sagarmatha National Park","National Parks",["Human communities have adapted to extraordinary altitude.","Glacial valleys rise toward some of Earth's greatest peaks.","Traditional mountain settlements appear along popular trekking routes.","Sherpa communities live beneath the highest mountain on Earth.","Mount Everest is located within my boundaries."],[]],["Chitwan National Park","National Parks",["Grasslands and forests meet along river systems.","Visitors search for large mammals in lowland habitats.","Conservation has protected one of Asia's most distinctive rhinos.","I am a national park in southern Nepal.","One-horned rhinoceroses are among my most famous animals."],[]],["Ranthambore National Park","National Parks",["Ancient stone structures stand amid forests and lakes.","Large predators make my wildlife viewing famous.","Dry deciduous habitats dominate much of my landscape.","A ruined fort overlooks lakes where wild tigers are sometimes spotted.","Bengal tigers roam near a historic fort here."],[]],["Kaziranga National Park","National Parks",["Seasonal floods shape the grasslands and wetlands.","My conservation success is tied to a large horned mammal.","Tall grasses and rivers support diverse wildlife.","Floodplain grasslands protect unusually large numbers of one-horned rhinoceroses.","I protect one of the world's largest populations of Indian one-horned rhinoceros."],[]],["Gir National Park","National Parks",["Dry forest supports an unusual population of large predators.","My region is important for a species found nowhere else in the wild.","Conservation efforts have preserved a rare lion population.","The last wild population of Asiatic lions lives in and around my forests.","Asiatic lions survive in and around my protected forest."],[]],["Sundarbans National Park","National Parks",["Tides and saltwater channels divide my landscape.","Dense coastal vegetation provides shelter for distinctive wildlife.","Large predators move between mangrove islands.","Tidal channels wind through mangroves where Bengal tigers roam.","Royal Bengal tigers inhabit my vast mangrove forests."],[]],["Hemis National Park","National Parks",["My high-altitude environment is harsh and sparsely populated.","Mountain animals have adapted to thin air and cold.","Rocky cliffs provide habitat for an elusive predator.","An elusive spotted predator survives in my high-altitude Himalayan valleys.","Snow leopards are a famous focus of wildlife expeditions here."],[]],["Corbett National Park","National Parks",["Rivers run through sal forests and grasslands.","My history is closely connected to wildlife protection.","Visitors search for large cats and elephants.","My forests protect tigers and elephants beside Himalayan foothill rivers.","I was among India's first national parks and am named for Jim Corbett."],[]],["Yala National Park","National Parks",["My habitats include lagoons, scrub forest and coastal areas.","Large mammals share the landscape with many bird species.","Wildlife drives offer opportunities to glimpse elusive spotted predators.","I am a national park in southeastern Sri Lanka.","Leopards are a major attraction in my protected area."],[]],["Wilpattu National Park","National Parks",["Natural shallow lakes are characteristic of my landscape.","Dry-zone forest supports many mammals and birds.","My name is associated with rainwater-filled depressions.","I am a large national park in northwestern Sri Lanka.","My villu lakes distinguish me from other wildlife reserves."],[]],["Horton Plains National Park","National Parks",["Cool highland grassland contrasts with surrounding lower forests.","Mist can conceal steep cliffs and waterfalls.","My landscapes support unusual endemic wildlife.","A high-altitude plateau ends abruptly at a cliff known as World's End.","World's End is a famous sheer escarpment at my edge."],[]],["Nikko National Park","National Parks",["My cultural heritage and mountain landscape are closely intertwined.","Lakes and waterfalls attract visitors in changing seasons.","Shrines and temples sit among forested hills.","Shrines and a tall waterfall lie near a lake above forested Japanese mountains.","Lake Chūzenji and Kegon Falls are among my landmarks."],[]],["Fuji-Hakone-Izu National Park","National Parks",["My protected regions span mountains, islands and coastlines.","Volcanic activity has influenced much of my scenery.","Lakes and hot springs make my landscapes popular.","I am a national park across central Japan.","Japan's most iconic mountain is included in my territory."],[]],["Shiretoko National Park","National Parks",["Sea ice affects life along my coastline.","Forested mountains support large mammals and rare birds.","My remote peninsula is recognized for a rich ecosystem.","I am a national park on Japan's Hokkaido island.","Brown bears and seasonal drift ice are associated with me."],[]],["Daisetsuzan National Park","National Parks",["My high terrain experiences long cold winters.","Volcanic peaks and hot springs shape my mountains.","Autumn colors can arrive earlier here than elsewhere in the country.","I am a large national park on Hokkaido, Japan.","My name is often translated as Great Snowy Mountains."],[]]];
